// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3880089224" "So, yeah, it looks like we're a go for tonight.  Where do you want to meet up?"
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4282171379" "Uh huh.  Mm hm.  Yup.  Un huh.  Yes.  Right.  No, I'm not interested in switching phone companies."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3117754740" "Sure, call her, and we'll meet at the Mexican place."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3523590987" "Okay, I'll pick those up on the way home."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4191034257" "I feel so safe with all these heroes around. <em=clap> Hey, here's one!"
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P972861301" "You need to make it quick, my battery is running low."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1361524846" "Nah, you don't need an umbrella.  There's not a cloud in the sky."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2306803408" "I'm at the wrong spot?  Where did you say to meet you?"
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3380486938" "Can you say that again?  My reception's bad here."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2931345705" "No, I can't meet you today, sorry.  How about next week?"
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3186943126" "No, this phone doesn't take pictures.  Does yours?"
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2793524531" "I'm hearing you loud and clear.  In fact, I think you just shattered my ear drum."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1870813776" "Ascendant who?  Sorry, you have the wrong number."
// CITYZONE_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3346786514" "Sure, I'll pick up your cape from the dry cleaners."

// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P594659325" "Hm.  Looks like we're running low on a few supplies here."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P7490674" "Wow, who inventoried this stuff?  What a mess."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P164108540" "I'll have to send down to supply for more bandages."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2926864964" "Bandages.  Check.  <em=nod> Antiseptic.  Check."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3493608081" "Wow, did I write that?  I can't read my own handwriting."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3428754087" "Hm, it looks like some of these files are out of order."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P477766725" "I just love paperwork."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2963945828" "I wish I worked at the other hospital."

// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P602913959" "So in your professional opinion, what is the best course of action?"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P2121092002" "Right.  I was considering that tactic as well.  Good call, doctor."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P1442097599" "Mm hmm.  I would suggest that, as well."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P3827756264" "So, what do you think?"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_DOCTOR_TEXT :
"P2037364470" "You should tell him not to bend it that way."

// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_TEXT :
"P446212357" "Looks like it could be viral."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_TEXT :
"P373932758" "I say we prep for surgery."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_TEXT :
"P4244335680" "You can never be too careful when it comes to keeping our heroes safe."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_TEXT :
"P2190933069" "Great.  We're on the same page for further tests."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_COLLEAGUE_TEXT :
"P88466784" "The best course of action is one of aggressive caution."

// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P2397228476" "I hope my insurance covers this."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P1562193325" "So you're saying I shouldn't bend my elbow like this? <em=flexa>"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P1505114708" "So can I visit him later this evening?"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P1497524987" "When do you think you'll be able to get the results to me?"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P3523906452" "Okay, I'm not understanding you.  <em=no> Just give me the simple version."
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P1167418592" "How long before I can play tennis again?"
// CITYZONE_HOSPITAL_CONSULTING_PATIENT_TEXT :
"P4195727915" "I think you need to check those tests again.  That's impossible."

// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P3741328957" "Wow, deja vu."
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P4024328779" "Those heroes are really cleaning up the place."
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P4033631789" "I hope my contact gets here soon.  I must have read this same page fifty times."
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P764760770" "Hm.  Crime rate is down?"
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P1909030526" "Those heroes sure are on top of things."
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P3560931589" "Hey, who took the funny pages?"
// CITYZONE_NEWSPAPER_TEXT :
"P3725057170" "Hey, what happened to the Entertainment section?"

// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P3047545573" "I doubt I'll be meeting you guys after work.  I'm working overtime on this university to make some extra money."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P4156525183" "Didn't they say something about bringing in a masseuse once a week?"
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P3970334052" "Did you try In Front Steakhouse yet?  There's one on every corner, pal, you can't miss it."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P975223182" "Let's do Mexican for lunch today.  Can we all agree on Mexican food?"
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P1487341006" "Guys, can we all PLEASE agree on a place to eat?  For once?"
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P654147012" "You buying lunch today?  I'm broke."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P1673635498" "I went to university.  It didn't stick."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P909633856" "I love school.  I have a Ph.D. in philosophy, but this pays better."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P1122838807" "It feels like just yesterday that I was on the arena construction crew."
// ARENA_BREAKTIME_CHATTING_TEXT :
"P571317754" "I think I'll go back to school once this university is done."

// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P765147497" "Good job.  It looks like we'll need to make a few adjustments here or there, but we're in good shape."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3676446634" "Welding modifications ongoing.  Check."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P822642024" "Great, this foundation will be strong enough to take the university."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1490482374" "Yeah, I know you don't like working at night.  We just gotta get it done."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2752482886" "Hey, if I can work late.  You can work late."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P477197880" "Hey, it's late and I'm here.  Do you hear me complaining?"
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P296739886" "...ugh...writer's cramp..."
// ARENA_WELDING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P3114571364" "Where did the guy with the wheelbarrow go?"

// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P609711670" "Good work, men.  The university is coming along."
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P3701825939" "Nice job.  Keep it up."
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1856868206" "Hello, hero. <face=a>  The university is coming along, isn't it?"
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1768459263" "It's looking good, men.  The university will be done on schedule."
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P2640456083" "Quit griping about working in the dark.  The university has to get done."
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1898972270" "Am I complaining about working through the night?  No."
// ARENA_WELDING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P4165157447" "See how my arms are crossed?  This is my serious posture.  Get to work."

// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P3686845707" "Just a few more fixes and I can move on to the next task."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P1742867803" "Hm, I'll have to see if I can tweak this a little bit..."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P4093443586" "I hope Bob shows up soon, I'm getting tired."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P2152450461" "Hi there. <face=a>  Isn't it late for you to be out?"
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P2707044339" "And on we weld.  Weld.  Weld. Weld.  I'm glad it's not another Warehouse."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P4196992349" "Ow!  I think I just burnt my thumb."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P628233466" "I hate the graveyard shift."
// ARENA_WELDING_WELDER_TEXT :
"P1833149618" "Thank goodness my eyes are good.  I don't like working late, but higher learning is worth it."

// ARENA_WELDING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2175458525" "Yeah, boss.  I'm here with them now.  Yeah, he's fixing that as we speak."
// ARENA_WELDING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4114592138" "Sure, boss, I'll tell them.  Right.  Uh huh...<em=yes> I'll do that."
// ARENA_WELDING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2545475558" "Honey, I can't talk right now I'm at work.  <em=no>No, I can't.  Yes, I do love you.  Look, the guys are staring, I gotta go."
// ARENA_WELDING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1880266648" "Yes, sir, the welding project is moving along on schedule.  The university is progressing nicely."
// ARENA_WELDING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3878561448" "I know.  I'm here at the site now.  Yeah, it's gonna be a late night."

// ARENA_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1969455300" "Okay, guys, it says here you'll need to dig a few more feet to the left."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P1307680463" "Put your backs into it, men!"
// ARENA_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P246583623" "Okay, so I got two pizzas and a burrito. What do you want to drink?"
// ARENA_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P350215348" "I have the clipboard.  When you have the clipboard, you can tell people what to do."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CLIPBOARD_TEXT :
"P2995249483" "Quit looking at the heroes and get to work."

// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P1306544155" "I'm digging and he's scribbling on a clipboard..."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P2712125970" "Back...killing...me.  Need...bubble...bath..."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P56220073" "Wow, this ground is hard."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P639036224" "This is better than aerobics and the university will be fantastic."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P3284806367" "Hey.  <face=a> You gonna check out the university when it's done?"
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P998951530" "Hey, we got a break anytime soon?   I'm famished."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P3429206550" "Okay, ten more minutes then I'm going on break."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P3300418106" "I wish I were on Adam's crew.  They get pizza delivered to the site every Friday."
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P2977904094" "Okay, I don't want to be a stick in the mud, but wouldn't some heroes be able to do this faster and with less back strain?"
// ARENA_DIGGING_DIGGER_TEXT :
"P856532473" "Did you see that hero?  Some costume."

// ARENA_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P943605936" "Hello, hero. <face=a>  The university is coming along isn't it?"
// ARENA_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P167858507" "Easy there, son, you almost got dirt on my new suit."
// ARENA_DIGGING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P3789878363" "Impressive work, men.  The university will be complete in no time."

// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3625121610" "Sure, boss.  I'll look into it."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3913079926" "Any of you up for some overtime this weekend?  The boss says we gotta get this university done."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1036214640" "Right, honey, I know.  Yes, I DO love you.  Yes, I do.  I gotta go."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2989197542" "Honey, I've told you before.  Don't call me at work."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2638083793" "Honey, the guys are staring, okay?  I have a university to supervise.  Fine.  I'll pick it up on the way home."
// ARENA_DIGGING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P401031297" "Sweetie, what did daddy say about using Ice Blast on the fish tank? <em=stop> Back to work, men, nothing to see here."

// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P589722515" "I love pushing this wheelbarrow.  The university is worth it."
// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P1152309425" "When's Barry coming on shift?  My back is killing me and this university ain't gonna build itself."
// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P1237203634" "What is this rubble made of?  Lead?  Sheesh."
// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P3665085275" "Where am I taking this load again?"
// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P978323346" "I'd rather be digging."
// ARENA_CONSTRUCTION_WHEELBARREL_TEXT :
"P2067215055" "I can't wait until the university is done."

// ARENA_ARCHITECT_PLANS_TEXT :
"P3284091109" "Hm, yes, I see now.  It's coming along nicely.  Very nicely."
// ARENA_ARCHITECT_PLANS_TEXT :
"P1321297283" "Yes, that's about right.  A few small adjustments to the university foundation."
// ARENA_ARCHITECT_PLANS_TEXT :
"P2686017420" "Hm, I'll have to get head office to check on this.  The university must be perfect."
// ARENA_ARCHITECT_PLANS_TEXT :
"P2557610561" "It's all coming together.  The university will be completed on time."
// ARENA_ARCHITECT_PLANS_TEXT :
"P3575154642" "Thanks, Bob.  Nice job yourself.  Let's go for lunch."

