// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1A_TEXT :
"P3264657442" "I thought the Occult Studies Annex was supposed to be the party campus. Boy, was I wrong."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1A_TEXT :
"P3927608009" "It's scary in these streets."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1A_TEXT :
"P3912409689" "I never feel safe here."

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1B_TEXT :
"P3085281852" "Dude, nothing's normal around here."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1B_TEXT :
"P704024929" "Yeah, man, this place is strange."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1B_TEXT :
"P3594006727" "You said it. Come graduation, I am so outta here."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CONVERSE1B_TEXT :
"P243506085" "Yeah. On the plus side, Salamanca's been pretty good for my poetry."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_FIELDWORKER_TEXT :
"P784478196" "We better get back to the village soon."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_FIELDWORKER_TEXT :
"P2627673364" "It's not safe here."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_FIELDWORKER_TEXT :
"P735333604" "Did I just hear something?"

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROW_TEXT :
"P1741811669" "I hear there's a hero's spirit trapped here. Something about penance, or regret. War Witch's her name."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROW_TEXT :
"P3834539346" "Someone told me those spooks are from Ireland. Not sure I believe it."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROW_TEXT :
"P3503606196" "I heard those strange women can summon the power of lightening. Frightening stuff."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGPICKAXE_TEXT :
"P3558389026" "My sister turned into one of the ghosts. I sure hope someone can set her spirit free."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGPICKAXE_TEXT :
"P1571872853" "I'm tired of being afraid all the time."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGPICKAXE_TEXT :
"P3606547143" "I hope someone can save us from these critters."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGSHOVEL_TEXT :
"P279379713" "Dig, dig, dig, that's all I ever do."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGSHOVEL_TEXT :
"P1783814621" "I can't wait to get back home."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_DIGGINGSHOVEL_TEXT :
"P2187085475" "The nights are getting longer, I think."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROWMOVINGROCKS_TEXT :
"P3182766765" "It's cold out here in the fields."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROWMOVINGROCKS_TEXT :
"P530035221" "The wife wants me home soon."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_WHEELBARROWMOVINGROCKS_TEXT :
"P1992474908" "Used to be nothing I liked better than a day out here in the sun."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_REPAIRINGBARN_TEXT :
"P1002711504" "This barn's been here three generations or more. I can't let it fall now."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_REPAIRINGBARN_TEXT :
"P3258440546" "My family's got a history in Salamanca. I'm staying."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_REPAIRINGBARN_TEXT :
"P2953306976" "Oh, I've been working on the hay barn, all the livelong day..."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_CARRYINGCRATE_TEXT :
"P2431781028" "My girl keeps talking about moving down to Paragon City. I told her we'd take our chances right here."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_CARRYINGCRATE_TEXT :
"P844134249" "Ain't nothing wrong with Salamanca. 'Cept for the ghosts, I mean."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_CARRYINGCRATE_TEXT :
"P1509897594" "I don't plan to desert our mayor. No, sir. I'll stay right here."

// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_PULLINGWEEDS_TEXT :
"P2210098807" "Darn. That one wasn't a weed."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_PULLINGWEEDS_TEXT :
"P2481422162" "It's a dirty job, but someone's got to do it."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_PULLINGWEEDS_TEXT :
"P75362803" "Honestly. These things just won't quit."
// CROATOA_FARMER_NPC_PULLINGWEEDS_TEXT :
"P175227949" "This organic produce better sell like hot cakes. It's enough work."

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_READING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P1932950174" "Oh! The leg bone's connected to the hip bone!"
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_READING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3990345664" "Man, this Shakespeare guy really knew how it was."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_READING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3836162061" "Why didn't I just major in Phys Ed?"
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_READING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P4250946538" "Ssh, discrete math."

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKS_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3762960755" "Ok, calm down. When in doubt, the answer is C."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKS_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P144817634" "I am so not gonna pass this thing."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKS_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3192057208" "That was the roughest test of my life."

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKSRUNNING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P1062998215" "Can't talk, got to run."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKSRUNNING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3670304837" "I'm going to be late for class!"
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_CARRYINGBOOKSRUNNING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3098348092" "Can't stay on these streets too long."

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_STRETCHING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3393801439" "Who has time for class on a day like this?"
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_STRETCHING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P2173019145" "Dude, I have got to get my own room."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_STRETCHING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P878647045" "Party at my place tonight. Pass it on!"

// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_SITTING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P27917718" "Well, if I flunk, at least I get out of this crazy place."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_SITTING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P2636059868" "I tell you, Prof Leery really knows his stuff."
// CROATOA_UNIVERSITY_NPC_SITTING_INACTIVE1_TEXT :
"P3317228909" "All I said was, you've got no plot, no meaning, and no characters. Then she hit me!"

// CROATOA_READINGINNEWS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2369798307" "Well look at this... 'The Paragon Transit Authority has recently re-opened their Northern Green Line station.' I wonder why it was closed for so long."
// CROATOA_READINGINNEWS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P760102812" "Wow, I've never been that far North before. Now that I can take the monorail there, I should go up there sometime."
// CROATOA_READINGINNEWS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3148900573" "I hear the North is really nice in Autumn."

// CROATOA_MONORAIL_DIDYOUHEAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1114137867" "Hey, did you hear that they just re-opened the Northern Green Line station?"
// CROATOA_MONORAIL_DIDYOUHEAR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P440150007" "Hey, did you hear the Green Line was recently extended?"

// CROATOA_MONORAIL_ITSABOUTTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2331293518" "Yeah, I heard about that, it's been closed since the Rikti War. I've never been up there."
// CROATOA_MONORAIL_ITSABOUTTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P757683535" "Yes I did, and it's about time."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P206455555" "All I'm saying is, with the market how it is today, you can't spend too much time dawdling.  You gotta make your mark."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P458472297" "Sure, you can think about it, but it's not like this deal is going to sit around and wait for you."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2219397734" "Look, all I'm saying is if you want in the game, you need to pay to play."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P3267993019" "Business is picking up.  Between the heroes and the Freedom Corps making their presence known, this place is a lot safer than it used to be.  Sort of."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P223548403" "I heard it through the grapevine that with everything going on in the Rogue Isles it's done wonders for stock here in Paragon City."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1332754507" "Yeah, I see what you're saying."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P3094192084" "Right.  Got it.  Just give me a moment, this is a big decision."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2124899577" "Yeah, I just don't know...  Can I get back to you?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2046391802" "Interesting."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2853027320" "Think so?"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P1356166374" "WHAT is the deal?  I have been standing here for DAYS and not one bus.  Why put a bus stop here if there's no bus?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P90678330" "Did I miss it?  Did I miss the bus?  How long have I been waiting?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P3903340989" "Is this an old schedule?"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2207507605" "Yeah, I'm in Atlas Park.  There's Freedom Corps here patrolling the streets.  You should see it."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3007074176" "Yeah, I'll be home.  I'm still in Atlas Park.  I'll catch the late monorail."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P3380620976" "This stupid cell phone doesn't have a camera on it.  Freedom Corps in Atlas Park.  Come over with your camera!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1980235826" "AllStar?  He's a bum.  I lost big on that Arena fight because of him."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2603951978" "See the Freedom Corps patrolling the streets?  They're helping the heroes."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P64519039" "You know, even though the heroes are here and the Freedom Corps are here, I still see thugs.  Why don't they learn?"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2275885021" "I hear you."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P4014455548" "Totally."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P402397016" "Right on."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P486795360" "Absolutely."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P3230305851" "You got it."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P1706657592" "Free Sally!  Take one!  Free Sally!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P1738466257" "Paragon Dance Party!  Don't miss it!  Take a flyer!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2823834370" "Rebuild Boomtown!  Come on!  Take a flyer!  Get involved, people!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P753114212" "Join the fight, heroes!  It's your duty to teach those villains a lesson!  Go to Siren's Call and show your support NOW!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P1288922296" "War Witch for local council!  Don't discriminate against the breathing-challenged!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P4167930765" "Clean up Faultline!  Fill those cracks!  Take a pamphlet!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2211270777" "Knowledge is power, people!  Take a pamphlet!  Get involved!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3171103818" "Self Defense classes! Come on, ladies!  Your purses will thank you!  Take a flyer!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2729221552" "I don't know what's on this flyer, but read it anyway!  Get involved!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2205861987" "Clean up Perez Park!  Burn down half of it!  It's a villain-infested maze!"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1718319924" "I LOVE this place.  Man, that was a great shot."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2611234971" "Hold it...did grandpa say this was digital or film?  I don't think I loaded it."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P3416184455" "I'm a genius.  I should sell these works of art."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P4018226540" "I'm brilliant.  Perfect balance of shade and light."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P1074486404" "I'm so glad I went to art school.  This is MUCH better than those stick men I used to draw."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P4225256938" "And to think, all this brilliance stemmed from one quick sketch of Cubby..."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P4026217669" "Galaxy City is a great place to work.  It's a bit tucked away, but I'm ok with that.  My commute is negligible."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1530049114" "Hm.  Interesting."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2010430039" "Meh."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1065466720" "I agree."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSINESSPEOPLE_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1210348729" "Time will tell, I think."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P2686323304" "Not one bus.  Right stop?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P1150246055" "Well that's weird.  I haven't seen a bus in hours."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_BUSSTOP_NPC_TEXT :
"P1272378524" "I could have walked from here to Eden by now."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P1816755350" "Sure, I'll meet you at the place we had lunch that time.  Sound good?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P2173235183" "I've been standing here for FIFTEEN minutes.  Think you could pick it up a little?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_NPC_TEXT :
"P4147667995" "I don't know...somewhere in Galaxy City.  I can't find a street sign to save my life.  Ask a Paragon Policeman?  Huh.  Never thought of that."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2184786062" "Want to take a movie in at the theatre later?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P679979209" "Let's go get some food.  I'm starving.  Mexican?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2366827948" "Did you see the Paragon Police patrolling the streets?  I saw some Freedom Corps, too.  Let's see how those hooligans like it now!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_A_TEXT :
"P2078725669" "I'm thinking of taking the monorail over to Steel Canyon later.  Care to join me?"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P1930773782" "That's a thought..."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P2870056576" "Could do..."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P3580911350" "You think so?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P4276950064" "Let me think about that for a second."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_CHAT_NPC_B_TEXT :
"P522574473" "Hmm..."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P1880203401" "Take a pamphlet!  Get involved!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3382910454" "Galaxy City needs you to get involved!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1694907256" "Incredible.  One more shot."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2979109161" "Beautiful.  One more shot."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P872289349" "I'm a fantastic photographer."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_TOURIST_SKETCH_TEXT :
"P974887385" "I'm brilliant.  Galaxy City is an amazing subject.  So many...layers."

// POCKETD_NPC_BARTENDER_TEXT :
"P772796544" "What can I get you?"
// POCKETD_NPC_BARTENDER_TEXT :
"P1415458964" "Welcome to Pocket D.  What can I get you?"
// POCKETD_NPC_BARTENDER_TEXT :
"P866091296" "Sup?"
// POCKETD_NPC_BARTENDER_TEXT :
"P1082249959" "What can I get you tonight?"
// POCKETD_NPC_BARTENDER_TEXT :
"P3868202696" "Hi, welcome to Pocket D.  What can I get you?"

// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2394008898" "What?  I can't hear you!  I'm at Pocket D!  Yeah, new nightclub!  Get over here!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2212349495" "Speak up!  I'm at Pocket D!  Can't hear a thing you're saying!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P18387204" "What did you say?  Of course I can't hear you!  I'm in a nightclub!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3497134808" "Can't you just text it?  I'm in a nightclub!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1629712980" "You need to check this Pocket D nightclub out.  Seriously."
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3922310098" "Seriously?  Seriously!  Get over here!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3901899417" "I have no idea how I got here.  I just went through a door and BAM!, I'm in this club!"
// POCKETD_NPC_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2068129294" "I can't even describe it to you.  Seriously.  The camera on this phone would not do it justice.  Just get over here.  No I can't give you directions."

// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P332037980" "What's your sign?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2445438155" "Come here often?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2462295222" "You work out?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3302405130" "Hello, I'm a thief.  I'm here to steal your heart."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3326091288" "What's a nice girl like you doing in a place like this?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P785694695" "Your eyes are blue, like the ocean. And baby, I'm lost at sea."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1456659913" "Am I dead, Angel? Cause this must be heaven!"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2384426283" "Excuse me, do you have any raisins? How about a date?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1537098431" "I just want to tell you that you have a price to pay for being this cute, and I'm here to collect... your phone number, that is."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3958317692" "Do you have a map?  I just keep getting lost in your eyes."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P416754069" "Do you believe in love at first sight, or should I walk by again?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2448332727" "I'm betting that you cannot wait until tomorrow, because I bet that you get more and more beautiful every day."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2245450283" "You know the Power company is looking for you because you're so electrifying."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1606701540" "You know, I ain't this tall. I'm just sitting on my wallet."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1892559887" "If I could rearrange the alphabet, I'd put U and I together."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3283477183" "What's a nice girl like you doing with a face like that?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2757319900" "Damn, if being sexy was a crime, you'd be guilty as charged!"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2283494576" "You are so beautiful that you give the sun a reason to shine."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2403063278" "You've made me so nervous that I've totally forgotten my standard pick-up line."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P4229823599" "It's not my fault I fell in love. You are the one that tripped me."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1335064998" "Do you have a Band-Aid? Cos I just scraped my knee falling for you."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P639069320" "Girl, you gotta be tired because you've been runnin' through my mind all day."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P550436069" "Help, something's wrong with my eyes.  I just can't take them off you."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P1019718034" "You're like a dictionary - you add meaning to my life!"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2221485004" "If I received a nickel for every time I saw someone as beautiful as you, I'd have five cents."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3385314045" "If you were a laser, you'd be set on 'stunning'."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P632706041" "Be unique and different, say yes."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P106322300" "Baby, you must be a broom, cause you just swept me off my feet."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3173656351" "I know milk does a body good, but damn girl, how much have you been drinking?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P2625729995" "Are you a parking ticket?  Because, honey, you've got 'fine' written all over you."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P274534528" "Inheriting eighty million bucks doesn't mean much when you have a weak heart."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_PICKUPGUY_TEXT :
"P3979346303" "So yeah, I used to go to the Paragon Dance Party, but this...this is my kinda place.  Soooo classy."

// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P111348722" "What?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P1002176119" "Are you serious?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P1916132715" "Has that line EVER worked for you?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P3791458633" "Ugh."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P2611591718" "You're kidding me, right?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P3213854648" "No.  Again."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P95192344" "Go away."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P1601821020" "I like your approach, now let's see your departure."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P2215491518" "Hm.  Let me think about it."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P1546520771" "We'll see."
// POCKETD_LOUNGELARRY_FEMALETURNDOWN_TEXT :
"P1035308903" "My girlfriends are here.  I can't just leave them."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P2428623385" "Hey, what say we head back to my base?  I'll show you my evil plots."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P1362057073" "So, what are you doing later?  After the Shady Deal, Mugging, Break In, and Rumble?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P3381424710" "You're hot."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P1032153997" "You busy later?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P3443725054" "Can't we all just get along?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P294074447" "I'm doing my part for interdimensional relations.  Would you like to do yours?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MALE_TEXT :
"P2645692423" "What say we blow this place and head back to my base?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1746460023" "You realize, of course, that I could break your neck like a twig."

// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P2369143042" "I wuz jusht reshting my eyes."
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P3023576701" "Huh?  Who?  What?  Aw, you go home!"
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P489712892" "I'll be there in a minute!"
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P916244967" "Huh?"
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P4105456763" "Wha...?"
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P3083895780" "I'm going.  I'm going."
// POCKETD_NPC_STAGGER_TEXT :
"P1500980570" "Aw, put a sock in it.  I'm going."

// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2526149993" "Hey, how YOU doin'?"
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2484436025" "What's up?"
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P4201349063" "How's it goin'?"
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2635361541" "How you likin' it here so far?"
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P3022897061" "Wassup?"
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P1071041114" "So..."
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P1055209138" "Check with the bartender upstairs."
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P4213246058" "Nice costume."
// POCKETD_NPC_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2584054460" "Busy later?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P3707696061" "Hey, wanna come back to my place?  I'll show you some wicked sculpture."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P4260875912" "See these markings?  No painkillers for any of 'em."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P1247396562" "Honey, I am all that AND a bag of chips."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P1718893108" "You need to take a walk on the freak side."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P324751461" "You are HOT.  You single?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P1768212747" "I love your knives.  You know, you can use them on me later if ya want."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREAK_MALE_TEXT :
"P3783467499" "You Artemis girls are so hot.  I'm really into sharp objects."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P320272764" "Right."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3663500748" "I'm so fascinated."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3398672242" "That is...remarkable."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2298548275" "Wow.  That's so fascinating."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P164143039" "Yeah, so it took months for them to tailor these costumes just right.  Nothing is too much for Lord Recluse."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1653520598" "So, hey, we could head back to Grandville later, I can give you a tour of my place if you're interested."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P4290579711" "You know, underneath all of this, I'm really a sensitive guy."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1220740373" "So, hey, Crey.  All it's cracked up to be?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P355692194" "You know, you make black suits and com devices look REALLY attractive.  That's turned off, right?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P2248612685" "So I've been promoted. I relocated to Grandville under Black Scorpion.  Wanna see my badge?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P4009890407" "So I've been promoted.  I relocated to Grandville under Captain Mako.  I got the badge to prove it right here."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_MALE_TEXT :
"P3542795136" "Scirocco is my patron.  I just got promoted to Grandville.  It's a big deal, as you can probably guess."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2320504155" "Do I have 'idiot' tattooed to my forehead?  I'm just wondering because you're talking to me like you really think I'm interested in what you're saying."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2517636043" "It's my night off.  The com device is offline and Countess Crey will not be calling me tonight.  So tell me more about yourself.  More than just the last hour."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3858721223" "I--"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2050428018" "Well I--"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P724083378" "Once I--"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3126983934" "Thanks, so--"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1920872594" "Hm...interesting."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_MALE_TEXT :
"P3100967603" "Personally, I think Crey has a bad rap.  I'M a decent guy...right?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_MALE_TEXT :
"P3952770373" "You know, it's not easy being who I am.  Behind the fancy costume and the big muscles, I'm really a sensitive guy."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_MALE_TEXT :
"P2364327158" "You know, one day I'm just going to retire from Crey Corporation and buy a farm.  I'd like to have a big family.  Maybe a dog."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_MALE_TEXT :
"P3851156071" "You know, you make face paint and harlequin style look really attractive.  I'm not just saying that because I can see your navel."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CREY_MALE_TEXT :
"P2133418370" "Those colors are so perfect for you.  The whole ensemble.  It's alluring yet tasteful.  Busy later?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2710850485" "You look like you can take a great deal of pain."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2021189688" "I see those gums flapping, lovey, but nothing really useful is coming out."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2806931529" "Riiiight."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2754744004" "Is that so?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3553745229" "No kidding."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P61185856" "You think?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3755390222" "Darling, I could just rip you limb from limb."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CARNIVAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3189298119" "How deliciously simple you are."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_MALE_TEXT :
"P57851507" "I love a girl in uniform.  So...hey...does the kerchief ever come off?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_MALE_TEXT :
"P1942149425" "You're so very mysterious in that outfit.  And those blades, wow..."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_MALE_TEXT :
"P3066381910" "So I'm a regular guy.  I like to dine out, hike, stay in shape.  You know, that kind of stuff.  You look pretty in shape.  We should go workout sometime."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_MALE_TEXT :
"P2350143795" "So, I've been noticing more activity from Nemesis lately.  I'm sure you Artemis girls keep track of that stuff."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MOOKS_MALE_TEXT :
"P903666485" "Baby, you are ALL THAT in that helmet.  You shine like some kinda bauble-y thing."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MOOKS_MALE_TEXT :
"P965284908" "Youse wanna come back wit me and we can see what's under that mask?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MOOKS_MALE_TEXT :
"P704950662" "How YOU doin'?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MOOKS_MALE_TEXT :
"P4032416367" "I work out.  That's why I'm so buff.  You like buff guys?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_MOOKS_MALE_TEXT :
"P79465517" "So my buddy, Sal, bet me that if I came over here and talked to you, you wouldn't go out with me.  Wanna get dinner with the bet money?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2168073720" "My dear, for the fifth time, it's just not going to happen."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3259345906" "That is a truly...er...fascinating story, however, I'm just not...your type."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1535073014" "Well that sounds just lovely.  My goodness, time does fly, doesn't it?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2879275415" "I see."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2956546816" "Hm.  Is that a fact?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_ARACHNOS_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3899536396" "Let me think on it."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_NEMESIS_MALE_TEXT :
"P2304325426" "Beneath this suit of armor is a heart of gold, ma'am.  Truly.  A soldier is bound by his word."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_NEMESIS_MALE_TEXT :
"P3530136556" "You are truly striking.  Those materials offset the beauty of your features."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_NEMESIS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1649495318" "Ma'am, would it be too forward of me to ask you for your name?  You really are quite fetching, you know."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3103603583" "Oh my..."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3428040361" "So...tell me about your hobbies..."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2307280413" "Well that's--"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P293319923" "Pardon me?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FREEDOM_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2330106550" "Well...thank you."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKULLS_MALE_TEXT :
"P3212913374" "Baby, you're so hot, I can't think straight."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKULLS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1840957902" "I just forgot my own name looking at you in that outfit."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKULLS_MALE_TEXT :
"P4105679707" "So, yeah...you may have seen some of my work around town.  I'm quite the 'all city king'."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKULLS_MALE_TEXT :
"P778813131" "I can bench press 240 pounds.  Gotta keep in shape in my line of work."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TSOO_MALE_TEXT :
"P1207156741" "You are more beautiful than the rising sun."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TSOO_MALE_TEXT :
"P533091360" "Your eyes are as blue as the sky in summertime."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TSOO_MALE_TEXT :
"P4273685174" "You are a flower blossom."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TSOO_MALE_TEXT :
"P2488185235" "You are delicate like a petal, yet strong and sure."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WARRIORS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1398203836" "You are so fine in that business suit and ear thing.  Dang, girl, you gotta go out with me."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WARRIORS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1109025741" "So, you've heard of my homies?  I got far reaching influence from Steel Canyon to Talos Island."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WARRIORS_MALE_TEXT :
"P3768763308" "So I lost my puppy..."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_COUNCIL_MALE_TEXT :
"P2107485599" "So, I don't know if you know this but...I was just accepted into Archon Voss' giant robot pilot program.  You impressed?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_COUNCIL_MALE_TEXT :
"P3057366677" "I don't know what happened.  I go on leave, come back...suddenly we got new world order initiatives, these uniforms, a new name..."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_COUNCIL_MALE_TEXT :
"P1895748291" "Yeah, you know, I kind of miss the red and black."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_DOCKWORKER_MALE_TEXT :
"P418383889" "You know behind these overalls and the flannel shirt, I'm really a sensitive guy."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_DOCKWORKER_MALE_TEXT :
"P4261868589" "I may look rough around the edges, but in reality, I have very eclectic interests."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_DOCKWORKER_MALE_TEXT :
"P804014926" "Have you read the works of Shakespeare? They're really quite compelling."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FAMILY_MALE_TEXT :
"P2521904688" "Honey, you need to change your line of work.  I could find you a premiere gig in ANY of my nightclubs."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FAMILY_MALE_TEXT :
"P1806925645" "So...yeah...where you keep your wallet in that outfit?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FAMILY_MALE_TEXT :
"P3120980138" "It pays to be careful in my line of work.  So...what say you come by my place and I'll check your credentials?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_FAMILY_MALE_TEXT :
"P1888980381" "I got this casino in St. Martial.  We could head there later."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_OUTCASTS_MALE_TEXT :
"P175022304" "You're sharp.  I'm nasty.  Let's get together and see what happens."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_OUTCASTS_MALE_TEXT :
"P3092190727" "I'm diggin' the outfit, lady.  Classy in a mercenary kind of way.  I like that about you."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_OUTCASTS_MALE_TEXT :
"P2960865884" "So how good lookin' are you under that mask?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKYRAIDERS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1516517271" "Honey, you ARE the wind beneath my wings."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKYRAIDERS_MALE_TEXT :
"P1810799485" "I couldn't fly before I met you.  Now my feet just never seem to touch the ground."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SKYRAIDERS_MALE_TEXT :
"P4042893392" "Want me to take you for an moonlit aerial tour later?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TROLL_MALE_TEXT :
"P639763701" "You stitchy.  Me like."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TROLL_MALE_TEXT :
"P1397756704" "You wear black.  Me like lots."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TROLL_MALE_TEXT :
"P2953301466" "You good looking.  We go out."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TROLL_MALE_TEXT :
"P1849177069" "Me take you home.  K?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_TROLL_MALE_TEXT :
"P1898674640" "You my nightmare?  Me like that.  Me like that lots."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_VAHZILOK_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1694307846" "I am your worst nightmare."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_VAHZILOK_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P4089832996" "I could do things to you that would make your skin turn pink.  Or rather...blood red."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_VAHZILOK_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1944996348" "Well aren't you an interesting little green morsel?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_VAHZILOK_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1182449598" "Delicious..."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_VAHZILOK_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1582038133" "Perfect...specimen...  Well, except for the green."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WYVERN_MALE_TEXT :
"P2638107238" "My lady, you really are quite lovely.  Tis not a star in the sky that shines as brightly as you do."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WYVERN_MALE_TEXT :
"P27694265" "My lady, if you will permit me...I am enamoured by your wit and grace.  So few truly delicate women in these parts."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_WYVERN_MALE_TEXT :
"P2959187474" "You are a rare breed, my lady.  Would you care to join me for a dance?"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_ARACHNOS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2965308167" "Grandville is the place to be.  Lord Recluse...he knows scale."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_ARACHNOS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2376435277" "I figure I'll stick around here for a bit then head back to Grandville.  I gotta be back for my shift."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_ARACHNOS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2777803492" "Yeah, well we got our flyers and all.  But, you know, every now and then...a tent would be nice."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CARNIVAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1331490802" "Well, darling, that's insanely fascinating.  Now let's talk about me."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CARNIVAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1531689142" "Oh how delicious.  Now, dearie, let's talk about me."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CARNIVAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3877809117" "Is that so?  How frightfully wicked.  Now, let's talk about me."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CONSORTIUM_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2020165096" "It's a tough job, you know, keeping order.  But, hey, I look great in this uniform."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CONSORTIUM_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1930378648" "Yep.  The ladies really do dig the uniform.  What can I say?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CONSORTIUM_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1108401568" "Yeah, the ladies really do dig the uniform."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_COUNCIL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3388397164" "Interesting.   Did I tell you the story about that time in Striga..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_COUNCIL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P391332255" "Really?  Cool.  How about this one?  I come back from leave and the uniforms are different, the new world initiative is different.  Weirdest thing."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_COUNCIL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2291945054" "Yeah.  Interesting.  To be honest, I liked the black and red uniforms better."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CREY_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P55500038" "It's all about perception.  All the greats realize that."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CREY_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2639201098" "I got about ten minutes, then I need to head out.  I have a surveillance job to do."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CREY_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1740428469" "So...what's your plan for world domination?"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_DOCKWORKERS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3424971203" "Well, that's interesting.  I don't mean to get all political here, but..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_DOCKWORKERS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1424077411" "Sure.  But then...more power to the people, you know?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_DOCKWORKERS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3261651480" "Well, that's an interesting story.  Now let me tell you about a little thing I like to call 'reality'."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FREAKSHOW_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P127108832" "We're a creative misunderstood lot.  But we're also really messed up, too."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FREAKSHOW_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2177180171" "So you like to light things on fire?  That's cool.  Hey, check out this tattoo..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FREAKSHOW_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2409597069" "That was you guys?  Classic!"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_HELLIONS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P404805005" "Oh, yeah, baby.  Fire is the best.  I dig the spikes and tattoos, though."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_HELLIONS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1296684145" "So where's your pal?  The guy with the tv on his head?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_HELLIONS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P308460292" "Heh heh heh."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P831454075" "Well, being discreet and silent is clearly key.  Having a good sense of direction helps, too."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P86324826" "I practice with my knives every night.  I can slice the wings off a fly at 60 yards."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_KNIVESOFARTEMIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1611602409" "This club is so loud.  In my line of work, silence is golden.  Oh hey, is that DJ Zero?  He's great."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FAMILY_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P4075124670" "Hehe, that's great.  Yeah, so this club - it ain't half bad.  Not as nice as mine, of course."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FAMILY_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P238436839" "No kiddin'.  So, you'd think they'd spring for something a little more fancy than a warehouse."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FAMILY_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3969150832" "What's that?  Loud music!  Anyway, so back to what I was sayin' about that goombah of a nephew of mine..."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_MOOKS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P4196066340" "Oh yeah, we got our squabbles, but in the end is's all about who looks best in a muscle shirt, ya know?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_MOOKS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P4203061392" "Oh yeah, Dockside.  Well, Port Oakes...turf wars.  We gotta stick up for our territory, you know."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_MOOKS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P3561892258" "Hey, so I been on this rice and broccoli eating regimen.  I'm working on my muscle definition."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_OUTCASTS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P162100960" "Yeah, no kidding.  Hey, did you see that Carnival chick in the dance cage?  She is HOT!"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_OUTCASTS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P523869110" "I hear ya, pal.  Look, I'm gonna go head out to the dance floor.  Those Carnival broads electrify me."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_OUTCASTS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1360362720" "Heard that!"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_NEMESIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P3598726968" "There is no honour left in villainy these days.  No grace."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_NEMESIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2994822476" "A soldier's first loyalty must always be to his superior.  Without ranks, chaos is bound to break out.  Now a little planned chaos is okay..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_NEMESIS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P856937492" "Oh mainly, our platoon spends its time in Crey's Folly, but we've made a significant move to the Rogue Isles as well."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKYRAIDERS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P3476155348" "Too true.  Hey, I gotta jet in a few minutes."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKYRAIDERS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2973746713" "Is that mask heavy?"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKULLS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2728969154" "So, hey, lemme ask you.  That green skin.  Is that paint or what?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKULLS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1561790198" "So what's the word on that new Dyne shipment I keep hearing about?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKULLS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1424138429" "Is it true that Superadyne enhances your strength, but kills brain cells?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SKULLS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P3802397412" "Skyway, eh?  I'll have to check that place out.  I hang mostly in Steel, Kings, and Perez."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_TROLLS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2407535954" "Girls dig green."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_TROLLS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P7982217" "Me hook you up."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_TROLLS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1561982670" "Me want drink now.  You talk lots."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_TROLLS_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1339355646" "Me tired listening to you."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_TSOO_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1586997760" "Silence.  Speed.  Grace.  There is no substitute for those."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1938627694" "Perhaps not, but a good lawyer always helps."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WARRIORS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2326198471" "Some days, I'd just like to sit back and take a day off.  Go fishing.  I spend half my day fighting for territory.  A guy likes to relax, you know?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WARRIORS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P2404284094" "So, what do you think of this place?  Beats the pants off Paragon Dance Party.  Pretty weird hanging out with the competition, but I'm cool with it."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WARRIORS_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1884022878" "So, I'm about to head to the bar, want me to grab you something?"

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_VAHZILOK_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1479861089" "Interesting..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_VAHZILOK_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2849230937" "I see..."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_VAHZILOK_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P740056447" "Thanks.  Not my taste."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_VAHZILOK_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1985559739" "Sure."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WYVERN_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1799528163" "Too true.  There is no honour in combat anymore."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WYVERN_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2739874176" "Alas, the days of honourable combat have long since past.  I see you a knight of a sort so I'm sure you can understand."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_WYVERN_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P1704858642" "Too true, sir, too true."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_HELLION_MALE_TEXT :
"P641150173" "You're so hot, let's light this place up together!  I'm diggin' the outfit."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_HELLION_MALE_TEXT :
"P1831080446" "You make black look electric, baby."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_HELLION_MALE_TEXT :
"P1312720420" "Hey, all I'm sayin' is I think we got something here.  You look good in black.  I like to burn stuff.  Perfect match if you ask me."

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SPECTRALPIRATE_MALE_TEXT :
"P526008448" "Bless me stars, yer a sight fer sore eyes."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SPECTRALPIRATE_MALE_TEXT :
"P359055734" "Aye, me be a pirate, but I've a heart of gold, milady.  Stole it meself."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SPECTRALPIRATE_MALE_TEXT :
"P1089731187" "I be lookin' for a bachelor's wife if ye be interested.  Heh heh heh."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SPECTRALPIRATE_MALE_TEXT :
"P2279700381" "Clap me in irons, ye are a sight fer sore eyes!"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_SPECTRALPIRATE_MALE_TEXT :
"P308752086" "Ye seem a lady of expansive sensibility.  Care to join me fer a nipperkin?"

// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3622163392" "I have no idea what you're saying."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P2046588782" "A what?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P4124265172" "You want to what?"
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1460508084" "I don't think this is working out."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P1064207513" "Maybe."
// POCKETD_LOUNGEVILLAIN_CABAL_FEMALE_TEXT :
"P3785995946" "We'll talk later."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SPECTRALPIRATES_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1733589705" "Me mateys brought me.  They be here somewhere."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SPECTRALPIRATES_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P3289403032" "Aye, the life at sea, she's a tough one.  But ye don't want to hear me tongue waggin'."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_SPECTRALPIRATES_CHATTERA_TEXT :
"P1227621144" "Me ship is a great grand ship!  Ye should see it."

// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CABAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P4240624820" "Well that sounds simply fascinating."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CABAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2917888649" "Really?"
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CABAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P52909690" "I can imagine."
// POCKETD_VILLAINCHAT_CABAL_CHATTERB_TEXT :
"P2174852739" "How interesting."

// SKYWAY_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2845655651" "Look, people, there's no need to panic here.  The dam has a small leak and they're looking into it.  No need to move off to Steel Canyon just yet, alright?"
// SKYWAY_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2415117634" "If you could please quiet down, I can tell you what I know.  Yes, we have city planners looking into the situation.  They assure me that Skyway City will not be affected."
// SKYWAY_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4006315366" "I have no information on what started the leak.  I've heard speculation about the moon's affect on the tides.  No idea what that means."
// SKYWAY_TOWNMEETING_SPEAKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1728949866" "I can't answer that question, sorry.  Look, there's no need to panic.  The city officials are looking into it and they've already sent in construction and scientist crews."

// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3698555745" "Have you tried wearing a backpack?"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1348914852" "You know what would be nice?  Retirement at 35."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3924249393" "They never tell you about the paperwork when you sign up for this job."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2363850283" "Do you think we're missing out on the action just staying in here all day?"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3537109236" "Don't the bad guys ever sleep?"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913202697" "Sometimes I think it would be easier to be on the other end of the law."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1103765074" "Can you believe that punk kid made that doughnut joke to me? Like we haven't heard every joke in the book when it comes to cops!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2904856636" "My wife keeps trying to put me on a diet, But i just can't give up fast food."

// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2679980064" "Yes, ma'am."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3519866881" "We're very sorry for your inconvenience."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3417708113" "Yes, don't worry, ma'am."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1409018453" "These things just happen."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1613697134" "You need to calm down, ma'am."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2619989019" "I can't help you if you don't calm down."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3502023045" "Sounds like you're having a really bad day."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P840893145" "We're working as hard as we can, ma'am."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3638366356" "These things take time to sort out."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1578030473" "I'm sorry you feel that way."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4140069746" "We're trying our hardest ma'am."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_COP_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P666102697" "What did he look like again?"

// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P634592445" "This is the fifteenth time I've had my purse stolen!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P494849111" "Why do I bother coming here to report any crime? It never seems to change anything!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2757597644" "I knew I shouldn't have left the house this morning!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1739119238" "Are you even paying attention to me?!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P706592200" "Why does this stuff always happen to me?!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P101655652" "Don't you realize I'm the victim here!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2450539116" "Why are you just standing there, Go out and find them!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3613518657" "Last time he tried to get my purse i got away, I guess I wasn't that lucky this time."
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1980382434" "I didn't even get my replacement credit cards from the last time!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183137921" "Not only did he steal my purse, He insulted my hair!"
// PPD_ATMOSPHERIC_COPNPCCHAT_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3382972225" "Criminals these days are so unnecessarily rough! I would have handed it over if he said please!"

// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P762179270" "I'm cool with sitting here as long as they pay me."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P302496782" "So...what's the deal here, are they clearing out some of those freaky robed guys or are we supposed to fight them off while we work?"
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P2532031971" "I'm not doing anything until someone does something about those monsters out there.  Time and a half is NOT danger pay."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P3055374707" "Let the foreman stay all night.  I ain't letting my dinner get cold for this."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P765974341" "Okay, so we're getting paid and we're standing around until some city planner tells us we can go in.  I'm not seeing a problem here."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_TEXT :
"P3043407071" "Wanna head over to Skyway later for some food?  I'm getting hungry."

// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P610569797" "Honey?  I'll be late.  We're waiting on our work orders."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3748785083" "Well can't you pick her up from ballet?  I don't know how long I'm going to be here."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P666037560" "Honey, the dam is LEAKING.  I don't think it's that big a deal if I am a little late for dinner."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1439478735" "I can get you on the crew, but we're still waiting on work orders.  It might be a while."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2047127864" "Our foreman looks mad.  He's been on that walkie talkie for, like, two days straight.  Hasn't even left that spot.  This can't be good."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P571154447" "I don't know anything about what's going on.  I just come in, they tell me to move a few sandbags or plug some holes, and I do it.  Why?  What did you guys hear?"
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3599943879" "Seismic what's on the moon?  The MOON is making that dam leak?  How freakin' ridiculous can you be?  Who told you that?"
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1981225118" "Alls I'm sayin' is, I ain't gettin' paid to take heat from no Thorns or Vahzeelook or wind-up roboty things.  My butt is planted until I got major police protection."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P158848230" "Hey, those scientists can wade through those monsters all they want.  I don't move until I know it's safe."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2489282537" "I don't care if they got police protection.  As far as I'm concerned, it ain't enough."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P311099141" "Look, let's go get some food.  I don't think we're gonna be moving crates for a few hours yet."
// FAULTLINE_CONSTRUCTIONWORKERS_BREAK_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P56270413" "When those science-y guys are done, we'll start the surveying.  Gotta get the go-ahead from the Construction Foreman first, though."

// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P140242008" "Did they honestly think they could keep this quiet?  Ha!  I'm going to get awards for this!"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P773068500" "A few more, ah, perfect!  I'm going to be famous over this story!  MUCH better press coverage than what's on the street right now!"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2439568427" "Maybe I should interview those Clockwork.  I wonder if they mind their pictures being taken?  Who doesn't?"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1828069893" "This'll be my crowning glory.  I'll write the most investigative story in Paragon City.  The press out there right now is juvenile!"

// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_SIGNYELL_TEXT :
"P508683539" "You guys gotta let us know what's going on!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_SIGNYELL_TEXT :
"P2826148297" "If Skyway City isn't safe, we need to know!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_SIGNYELL_TEXT :
"P3509175102" "If that dam is going to blow wide open, you need to tell us!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_SIGNYELL_TEXT :
"P3690372348" "You guys are holding back information!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_SIGNYELL_TEXT :
"P3259456508" "We, as Paragon Citizens, demand to know EXACTLY what is going on!"

// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P774141176" "Yeah, I'll be at the theatre in an hour or so.  I got this protest thing for a bit."
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1706927193" "Huh?  I can't hear you.  Oh that?  Oh, we're protesting.  Why?  Can't remember, really."
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P124016427" "What?!  I can't hear you!  I'm protesting!  Lunch?  Sounds good?  Twenty minutes?"

// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P1131717930" "Knowledge is power!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P311853632" "Take a pamphlet, get involved!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P1658165878" "That dam can burst any minute!  Take a pamphlet!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P2570133485" "Paragon Citizens demand to know the truth.  Is the leak minor?  Or is it major!  We deserve answers!"
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P2313808290" "Take a pamphlet.  You deserve to know what's going on with that dam."
// FAULTLINE_SKYWAYCITY_PROTESTORS_PAMPHLET_TEXT :
"P4205896415" "Save our dam!"

// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1507482318" "Oh, I'm gonna be the first one to break this protestors story!"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P829977723" "This is better than the dam!"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3161636451" "I need to head over to the 'town meeting' later.  Maybe I can stir up some good press."
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P4287640579" "I'm the best reporter in Paragon City."
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3231378352" "I'm a fantastic photographer.  These pictures are gonna seal my promotion!"
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P419458503" "Now if only some of these guys would break into a fist fight.   THAT's good press."
// FAULTLINE_REPORTER_SKYWAYCITY_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1928613150" "Perfect shot.  My awards for this press coverage will fill rooms!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3742603584" "I'm telling you, housing prices here are UN-believable.  You really should act quickly."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P921685769" "Well, flood notwithstanding, the area's a dream and you really can't beat the price."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3219171936" "All you need to do is put your name on the list.  Oh my goodness, you can't believe the interest I'm getting in New Overbrook.  It's simply crazy!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P262707345" "Sure it's flooded, but it's a feature.  Waterfront property!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3963502830" "If I'm correct, and after twenty years in the business you can bet that I am, I see this neighborhood being sold out in weeks."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2072072094" "This is Paragon City, do you honestly think a few hoodlums will stop anyone from moving in here?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1602574532" "This property is prime real estate:  completely renovated, close to shops, and the hospital is just down the street."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P301811341" "I have a gut feeling that the prices will not stay low for long.  There is so much interest in New Overbrook, the prices will skyrocket as the housing supply is no longer able to meet demand."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P115310272" "How many apartments in Paragon City do YOU know that have palm trees OR swimming pools?  I'm telling you, it's simply the best you're going to see for the price."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2027647146" "Call me!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1275907307" "Minor setback!  Let's do lunch!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_REALESTATELADY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4286588412" "I'm sure I can get the owner to drop the price over this!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2107821989" "Well it sounds very nice, but let me have a moment to talk to my wife."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2594957198" "Do you have any with a master bath?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2575638573" "Well, we're just looking right now, so..."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1973450417" "The price is definitely tempting..."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2326286819" "What do you think, hon?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3621391281" "Well the price is pretty steep, considering it overlooks mass destruction..."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3808630911" "I don't know...I've lived in Atlas Park all my life.  This would be quite a change."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2809639379" "Sure!  We'll call you!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3193595757" "We'll talk terms later!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_FLEE_TEXT :
"P147009926" "Lunch Friday!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_HUSBAND_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1078925901" "I'll e-mail you with a reschedule date!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1541366660" "How close to the mall is it again?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1924064541" "And the corner units on the top floor are how much again?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3982930858" "Yes, yes, it really does seem quite extraordinary.  Of course, my husband and I need to talk before making a firm decision."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4108645930" "Honey, what do you think?  It seems quite reasonable, doesn't it?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4283655473" "I just love the palm trees.  And it's...well, it's sort of a gated community, too."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3115512515" "It has a secure parking garage?  Well that's new."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2390518270" "Well it was lovely meeting you!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1578800489" "We'll chat later!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1937119903" "Thanks for all your help!  Run faster, honey!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_APARTMENTSEEK_WIFE_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3166509713" "Thanks very much!  Run for the hospital, love!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P3631064243" "I'm exhausted.  I'm so exhausted, I can't even tell you how exhausted I am."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P2165491660" "I'm starving.  Someone get me some lunch.  My wife forgot to pack it."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P2921415203" "How much longer we got?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P1902687200" "Why do we never have any girls on our crew?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P2877511983" "Who do you think's gonna win the game tonight?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P3010430251" "No I didn't see the episode of 'Misplaced' last night.  Stop talking about it.  You're going to ruin it for me."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_ARMSCROSSED_TEXT :
"P420738655" "I think I'm gonna head over to that donut shop later.  That sign is just...beckoning me."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1607195864" "Sorry, honey, we're all working overtime tonight.  I'll try and get home as soon as I can."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3638086885" "Aw, don't be like that.  Tell Sofie I'll be home for dinner.  I'm trying to get out of here at a decent time."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1317595456" "You spent HOW much?  Honey, what did I tell you about online shopping!  I'm taking your credit card away.  I'm serious this time."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2101267974" "Yeah, we're making good progress on New Overbrook, considering all the interruptions and psychos trying to kill us all the time."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTIONCREW_RESTING_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2221772853" "Yeah sure.  I'll tell him.  Hey, Zeke?  Shane says the game's gonna be at Mel's tonight.  Make sure Josh brings the chips.  Okay back.  Where was I?"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2023095868" "Whooo-weee.  Quite a view from up here."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2744755829" "This is so much better than digging dirt."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2638694416" "So, what say we rest up here for a while then head down for a burger for lunch?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2925490081" "I'm hiding from my wife.  Why are you up here?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P1124264521" "Wow, don't they all just look like ants from up here?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P1285696173" "I feel from one of these cranes once.  Luckily, I landed on a Hydra Man.  He cushioned my fall, but I had to run REAL fast after that."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2125778590" "Nuts!  I left my lunch in the truck..."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_DONTRUN_TEXT :
"P2850755175" "Don't...run.  You'll break your neck."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_DONTRUN_TEXT :
"P3870499549" "I see 'em.  Just...don't move."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_DONTRUN_TEXT :
"P3819511073" "Pretend they're not there.  I'm not going to run and fall off this thing."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_DONTRUN_TEXT :
"P2228476461" "Uh oh.  Okay.  Don't move.  Shhh.  Don't move."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRANESIT_CHATTER_DONTRUN_TEXT :
"P2159542462" "Maybe they don't see us.  Don't move."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775829825" "Not there.  Over there."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1048263265" "No, your OTHER left.  Just move it, will you?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4183925308" "Hold it.  You're not supposed to be moving that.  Why are you moving that?  It's not on the list!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2483314073" "Who told you to put that there?  It wasn't me!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3484670879" "Lift with your legs NOT your back!  Honestly, did no one watch the safety video??"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P336348059" "Am I the only one around here who is remotely competent?  Honestly!  Oh just move it there.  I'll get someone with a brain to finish the job."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1587836602" "Seriously, guys, you are paid WAY too much.  All I ask...a crate...move it from A to B.  Is it too difficult?  Do I ask too much?  I don't think I do..."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P114618682" "Break time in 20 minutes."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3441890505" "Break time!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P765881226" "I don't get paid to be harassed!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2691671129" "I'm calling my shop steward!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2327867098" "Break time NOW!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3729296433" "Head for a store or a police drone!  Or the donut shop!  I'll meet you there!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRATEPATROL_TEXT :
"P2522589187" "Yeah, I've been hauling these crates all day.  I'd rather be digging at this point."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRATEPATROL_TEXT :
"P1018366414" "At this point, I don't think this place will ever be done.  Too many bad guys messing things up.  We can't get our work done!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRATEPATROL_TEXT :
"P1262633543" "Twenty more boxes and then I'm done."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_CRATEPATROL_TEXT :
"P405519471" "I hate carrying boxes."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_HANDCART_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4280387030" "I don't get paid for this!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_HANDCART_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2470194992" "I quit!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_PRYBAR_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1307356413" "This is ridiculous!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_PRYBAR_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2304343750" "I'm not scared of you!  I just don't want to miss out on the sprinkles at the donut shop!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P2086696558" "Wow.  We really do have a lot of work to do."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P3333764691" "Wow, that doesn't look good."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P2752463757" "Oh, man.  Not good.  Not good at all."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P2225608078" "What do I see?  I see months worth of work."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P4288483389" "What do I see?  Overtime and a lack of sleep."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_BINOCULARSGUY_TEXT :
"P2708189391" "Oh boy.  This is going to be a lot of work."


// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_CLIPBOARDGUY_TEXT :
"P3653731673" "That bad?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_CLIPBOARDGUY_TEXT :
"P3155053126" "Aw sheesh."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_SURVEYOR_CLIPBOARDGUY_TEXT :
"P3782595156" "Yeah, I thought it was gonna be bad.  Okay, give me the coordinates and we will go from there."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_WELDING_NIGHT_TEXT :
"P3037295498" "Just...great.  Working the night shift with all these freaking bad guys around.  I should have demanded more money."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_WELDING_NIGHT_TEXT :
"P2806714447" "How you doing over there?  I have a few more adjustments to make over here.  I can barely see anything!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_WELDING_NIGHT_TEXT :
"P3561810183" "Anything comes within spitting distance of me, I'm using this torch on it.  No lie, man.  We don't get paid enough for this stuff."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_WELDING_NIGHT_TEXT :
"P125100315" "This is so not worth just double time."



// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P248909553" "I come here every morning.  No fish.  What could be eating them?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P3847948534" "Ten more minutes, then I'll give up."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P1691215073" "Just ONE fish.  That's all I want.  Just one fish."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_TEXT :
"P657448646" "This would be a lot more fun if I caught something."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2869118550" "This is SO not worth it!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1741247621" "I will not be deterred!  I'll be back tomorrow!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_FISHING_FISHERMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2085187214" "You can't scare me that easy!  Well, except for right now!"

// FAULTLINE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1551221149" "I'm not sure how I feel about working here.  Not a lot of people, but a lot of construction crews coming in for patch-ups."
// FAULTLINE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3793543307" "It's not bad.  Beats working in Brickstown."
// FAULTLINE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TALKER_TEXT :
"P249612700" "Wanna get some coffee later?  Pretty quiet here so far."
// FAULTLINE_HOSPITAL_DOCTORS_TALKER_TEXT :
"P293857129" "Let's head over to the Drenched Donut later.  I'm in the mood for an eclair."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_HOSPITAL_SUPPLIES_CHECK_TEXT :
"P3066534196" "Hm...I thought we had some of those."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_HOSPITAL_SUPPLIES_CHECK_TEXT :
"P1263429494" "I can't afford to mess this up.  This is THE new hospital in Faultline.  It could be my job if I make a mistake."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_HOSPITAL_SUPPLIES_CHECK_TEXT :
"P2242691761" "Well that's just silly.  Twenty boxes of tape, but no bandages.  That makes no sense."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_HOSPITAL_SUPPLIES_CHECK_TEXT :
"P2898617436" "Whoever processed this supplies list needs to be reprimanded.  Unbelievable!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_SIT_TEXT :
"P3461811278" "Nice day, isn't it?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_SIT_TEXT :
"P168160574" "No pigeons.  I thought there'd be pigeons."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_SIT_TEXT :
"P2196743234" "Hm..."

// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2142473798" "I-I was just leaving!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3836349841" "Here!  You take the bench!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_PARKBENCH_FLEE_TEXT :
"P629334290" "Aaaaaaaaaaaaa!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P4249141907" "I could go for a donut.  What about you?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P472349014" "What do you think of that Mirror Spirit?  She's cute."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P4002025136" "Man, I'm so tired.  Got any Red Beast?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3415595415" "I'm on a split shift.  I hate those.  The day just DRAGS."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P523718463" "Hey, the guys were thinking of heading over to Infront Steakhouse later, wanna come?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2623965264" "Well, I've given the question a lot of thought.  I mean a LOT of thought.  I'd have to say my preference is sprinkles over glazed."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P114862172" "I just find it all frustrating.  How are we ever going to finish this construction if those Lost or Freakshow or whoever are always attacking us?"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3340925119" "Here we go again!  Meet you at Drenched Donuts!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2200241177" "Ack!  Make a run for it!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P518388896" "Oh for pete's sake!  Again?  Don't you fiends ever take time off?"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3342631087" "Yikes!  Run!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P404271554" "This is an excellent opportunity that I am really excited about.  Are you excited?  You should be!  You have the potential to earn a LOT of money!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1263124443" "Just hear me out.  This is not a routine telemarketing call.  I'm calling you specifically, Mr. uh...Smith, because you have won the prize of your choice.  All you have to do is..."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4224177694" "Yes, sir.  Yes, sir.  I will do that, sir.  Thank you for your time.  I appreciate that, sir.  No, I don't want you to come to my house and beat me up.  No I don't.  Yes, I will remove your name.  Thank you, sir.  Goodbye."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3314791781" "Well it's not just ANY vacuum cleaner, ma'am.   Pah!  Far from it.  This uses aerodynamic technology, has LCD visuals and maintenance monitoring.   It's a STEAL at three thousand dollars."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3238554946" "Well of course you want to make money.  Who doesn't?  If you'll just give me five minutes of your time I will explain how you, too, can earn money from home."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1572869965" "Who doesn't want to retire early.  With just a few small payments, I can send you materials that will put you well on your way to financial freedom in just a few short months."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2252826378" "You are a WINNER!  Congratulations, you have been selected to receive one of several FREE GIFTS!  Isn't that great!  I'm so excited for you!"

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P797198906" "I'm having technical difficulties with this phone!  I'll call you back!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2658159029" "Mr. Smith, I would love to continue discussing this with you, but something just came up.  I'll call you!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P315393260" "I'll call you back!"
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_TELEMARKETER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P646706267" "I would love to discuss this with you further!  Let me call you back!"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_BLUEPRINTS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P606048092" "Hm...  Looking good.  We're pretty close to being on schedule."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_BLUEPRINTS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P319687631" "Hmmm..."
// FAULTLINE_NPC_BLUEPRINTS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2810862369" "I'm going to need to look at the other prints later.  Are these the most up to date?"

// FAULTLINE_NPC_BLUEPRINTS_READER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1380877223" "You guys know what to do!"
// FAULTLINE_NPC_BLUEPRINTS_READER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3671586143" "Head for the nearest door!"

// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_TECHNICIAN_CHAT_TEXT :
"P1094105278" "Even with the damage and the leaks, the interior structure is not compromised."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_TECHNICIAN_CHAT_TEXT :
"P2267835828" "All systems are operational.  Even with the leak, nothing internal has been compromised.  We're structurally sound."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_TECHNICIAN_CHAT_TEXT :
"P3107099427" "Did you check the diagnostic report?  With all the activity at both entrances, we need to be vigilant with our spot checks and our maintenance schedules."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3071798449" "Did you know that my dad worked on the bridge to Baumtown?"
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2214506089" "Man, I remember when we put these walls up.  That was some work!"
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3166712847" "I really hope those Hellions don't try to torch our work site."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P867165620" "I don't think it gets better than this.  They pay us and we don't really have to finish anything."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P193622508" "Hey, this is good.  Want some?"
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1225418941" "I got peanut butter and jelly, who wants to trade?"
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3537253415" "I dunno.  I don't think they'll ever finish whatever they were gonna build.  But I am getting paid, so that's good enough for me."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4029132386" "Do you sometimes wonder if they know what they're doing?"
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4073728961" "Well, we all may as well take a break.  Nothing going on here."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2001312875" "We're on a break."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P260751680" "You got a problem, talk to my Supervisor."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4203871895" "Get comfortable.  We could be here a while."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_EAT_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1611889861" "Hey, they tell me to show up to the job site, I show up to the job site.  Even if it's been in the works forever."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P550354704" "I want that over there."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2680035561" "No, not there.  Over there.  The sheet says that's not supposed to be where you're putting it so move it."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3866056479" "Wait wait wait.  Not there.  Over there."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P811396934" "Hold it.  What's that in your hands?  That's not on the list."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P510650662" "Just keep working.  They won't bug you."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3809967926" "We got police presence.  Ignore the bad guys."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARDGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2782241984" "Work doesn't end because villains are around.  This city would never have been built.  Keep moving!"

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2869259142" "So I hear those Rikti aren't much of a threat anymore."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3679594603" "Yeah, taking the walls down after all this time for some top secret project?  Wonder what it is."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3539942588" "Ten more minutes then we'll head back.  I know I said that ten minutes ago, but I mean it this time."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3377698866" "I hope nothing bad happens if we take this wall down."

// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1880075027" "Stay put.  We got police presence.  Besides, they'll go for the guys in front first."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1927379348" "Whatever.  I see the bad guy, but I'm on break and I'm exhausted."
// STEELCANYON_NPC_CONSTRUCTION_LEDGESIT_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3340439525" "I'm too tired to run like an idiot for an unlocked door.  Maybe if we don't move, those bad guys won't bother us."

// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P1250569221" "Some Tiki lounge, hm?"
// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2295178382" "Sup.  How you liking the lounge?"
// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P4227736596" "That bartender cracks me up.  What is he, made out of wood?"
// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_WALL_LEAN_TEXT :
"P2022036236" "Hey, welcome to the lounge.  I come here all the time."

// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1571731954" "Ohmigosh, you have to see this.  Only VIPs can get in here!  Let me try and take a picture."
// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2152195190" "This place is sooooo cool.   Seriously!  It's the VIP room!  What do you mean, how did I get in here?"
// POCKETD_NPC_TIKI_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1082489098" "What?  I can't hear you!  I'm in the VIP room in Pocket D!  What??  It's like a Tiki lounge!"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P4092942414" "Could this line TAKE any longer?  There's three of us, for pete's sake."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P2196796540" "What are they doing up there?  Checking their bank balance?  Come ON already."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P3190542997" "Anytime now.  I'll have to register as a senior citizen if this line moves any slower."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P875430697" "My education can't wait, people, can we hurry this up a little?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P3232903322" "Mind over matter.  Mind over matter.  This isn't the longest wait in the history of waiting.  This is...an opportunity to practice patience.  Ahhhh...  Okay, this is ridiculous.  Come ON, people!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P540145778" "I need gum.  I'm gonna lose it in this line if I don't get gum soon."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LINEUP_BORED_TEXT :
"P964238113" "How long does it take to register for a class?!  Are you people using stone tablets??"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P2604842746" "I'm resting."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P411235597" "I'm not moving and you can't make me."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P3245343685" "Beat it, brainiac."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_BUM_SLUMP_NOT_MOVING_TEXT :
"P1850871360" "Get your own trash bag."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2313786231" "Hm.  Well, that's odd."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P579339866" "Well, I'll definitely need to pick up more of that."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3849640313" "Perfect.  All is in order."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1085211250" "Well, you make a very convincing case, I must say.  If I were, perhaps, a baboon."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3486961064" "Hm...  I see.  The answer is still no."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3303818782" "That would be a no."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3446979977" "I don't think so."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P996980241" "That's a new one."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1464167227" "I'm going to give you an A, but for effort only.  Sorry, you still get that D."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1509527479" "The thing about class is, you sort of have to show up and do the work.  I know.  Mean, right?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3125371220" "Wow, that is...probably the worst excuse I've ever heard."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P3847936230" "Nope.  THAT is the worst excuse I've ever heard."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_INSTRUCTOR_EXPLAIN_DENIED_TEXT :
"P1028310609" "You know, contrary to my smashing good looks and youthful personality, I was not, in fact, born yesterday."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3300108295" "It's TRUE.  I DO have a dog.  He DID eat it.  Why does no one believe me?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3213127273" "Well, I wanted to get it done, but I just couldn't bear the assignment not being perfect and I simply had to redo it.  It's only because I value your opinion so much, you know."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P2585251912" "It's just that, I've had such a crazy semester, you know?  All the par-- uhm...all the studying and research.  I don't think you realize how tough it is to be a student these days."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P2191125479" "Well, yes, I didn't do the assignment but I have a very good reason.  I just didn't feel like it."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P4024230979" "But it's true.  Last night I got amnesia and I totally forgot to do my assignment."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P273271561" "Well, I didn't realize the assignment was mandatory. I thought it was just...a suggestion."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3004192835" "Did we have that assignment?  No one told me we had that assignment!  Honest!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P3785907066" "Well, I think I would have remembered to do the assignment if it was so important."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P2945751125" "Well, I have a bad textbook.  It didn't have answers in it."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_LAB_STUDENT_EXPLAIN_TEXT :
"P637100132" "It's true.  My baby sister threw up on it.  I was doing you a FAVOR by not handing it in.  She had peas."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P4000074313" "Huh?  Wha?  What time is it?  Ack!  I missed my class!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P553576808" "I was just er...thinking about an assignment.  Trying to get a real focus on it.  Yeah...I'm uh...heading to focus some more elsewhere."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_PARKBENCH_SNOOZING_WAKEUP_TEXT :
"P685844869" "Er...you can have the bench.  I was just heading out."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P2846897601" "No super speeding in the halls!   This is a building for higher learning, people!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P2141758443" "Don't think I won't ticket you for super leaping over the campus building because I will!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P2742032023" "You a student here?  Let's see that student ID card."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P167365390" "Quiet in that Library!  This is a place of learning!"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P580648699" "Keep walking.  Don't loiter.  You'll clog up the area."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P1434712241" "Keep it moving, bub."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P3177491237" "You have that scared useless look about you.  You're probably in Boram's class."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_CAMPUS_SECURITY_TEXT :
"P2949236178" "Don't even THINK about littering on school property."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P2934755531" "You can't tell me you can study in El Super Mexicano, I don't care how many times you say it."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1047239013" "Uh huh...no, I have Taylor for that.  Who do you have?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P4258306807" "Sure, what time do you want to meet?  Library?  Cool."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P253365039" "Nah, my class is cancelled.  Some dork stuck a stink bomb in the Lab cupboards."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3624617221" "He did WHAT?!  Dump him."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P1840906402" "Who did you get for Salvage?  Yeah, me, too."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CELLPHONE_TEXT :
"P3582372646" "This is so unfair.  They want me to do an HOUR of homework.  By TOMORROW!  I know!  Isn't there, like, a law against that or something?"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2695244135" "I totally breezed through the program.  I am an A student, after all."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2344452394" "Do you think the dog eating my homework excuse will work this time?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P3438021148" "You could not PAY me to go to the Croatoa campus to study.  It is freaky there."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2161997148" "Wanna head out for some lunch off-campus?"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P150630527" "Mmm hmm..."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P4166230224" "Yeah, heard that."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P869689640" "Well, you certainly have a strong opinion about that."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P2942301325" "Huh?  Of course I'm listening."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P4258013842" "Well, all I know is my social life has totally improved since I joined Alpha Beta.  Totally."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P604882964" "Sure, he's cute, but he has a brain the size of a toothpick."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P241952263" "Think I should take that class I was telling you about?  Feng Shui is totally cool."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2875628434" "I have so much homework to do, I don't even have time to stress about it."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P995874369" "Well it's all just really really dramatic, I can't possibly explain to you how dramatic it all is.  Are you listening to me?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2876836985" "He didn't even call me.  He said he'd call me.  He didn't.  What kind of PERSON tells someone they will call and they don't?  What is THAT all about?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2000999159" "Can you believe it?  He called me the same day.  How desperate is THAT?"
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P947639537" "You know, you're my best friend forever.  I just love how we communicate so well together."

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P4287153800" "That's cool."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P2653697909" "Er...of course."
// HERO_UNIVERSITY_FEMALE_STUDENT_CHAT_LISTENER_TEXT :
"P1507774314" "Hmm?"

// HERO_UNIVERSITY_MALE_STUDENT_CHAT_CHATTER_TEXT :
"P2365152720" "You know, I have this system.  I read something and then come test time, I just hope it all comes back to me.  I mean, I'm sure I'd recognize something I'd read before, right?"


// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_MILITARY_COFFEEBREAK_TEXT :
"P2752345966" "How long is your assignment for?  Vanguard has me for six months."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_MILITARY_COFFEEBREAK_TEXT :
"P184298319" "I'm heading over to the Briefing Room after I finish my break.  It's been a long day."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_MILITARY_COFFEEBREAK_TEXT :
"P4208166056" "They just keep coming.  Have you seen those Pylons?  You do not want to get close."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_MILITARY_COFFEEBREAK_TEXT :
"P3871620951" "I know I'm supposed to be all detente with the whole villain-helping-us-out situation, but something about this whole thing just grinds me the wrong way."

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_BRIEFINGINSTRUCTOR_TEXT :
"P2883257584" "Does everyone have the plan?  You're on-call.  You assist with base operations unless specifically tasked by Vanguard Operatives for topside duty."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_BRIEFINGINSTRUCTOR_TEXT :
"P3751906189" "The armory needs a clean-up crew.  There are shell casings all over the place.  I want it done by 1800 hours."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_NPC_BRIEFINGINSTRUCTOR_TEXT :
"P3927823636" "All on-call personnel are to remain in the Vanguard Base unless assigned otherwise."

// VANGUARD_ATMOSPHERIC_SECURITY_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3439707097" "Civilians!  Exit the base!"
// VANGUARD_ATMOSPHERIC_SECURITY_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2548266312" "Conference attendees!  Exit the base!"
// VANGUARD_ATMOSPHERIC_SECURITY_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2187286270" "To the exits!  Now!"
// VANGUARD_ATMOSPHERIC_SECURITY_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3916640413" "Everyone not on security detail, leave the base!"

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2984320774" "Well, it's just really important, isn't it?  Finally an end to the war?  This conference must succeed."
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4162472977" "Of course it feels a little strange seeing the Traditionalist Rikti and humans talking about peace.  But, if this conference can end the war, a little awkwardness is well worth it."
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4025809913" "I just hope the negotiations go smoothly.  This peace conference is so important.  For all of us."
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2657797026" "Well, of course we're all doing our part to ensure that this peace conference achieves its goals.  Ending this war with the Rikti is paramount."

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4284893079" "Run!  Quickly!  Let them take care of it!"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3496974583" "Take cover!"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P334777851" "Nemesis!"

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2519621570" "I think this conference will be a very good thing for us.  Don't you?"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2130303065" "Well, it doesn't need to be said that we are all working very hard in all levels of government to ensure this conference succeeds."
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3935398005" "I'm so glad that you are here.  If we can negotiate peace between Rikti and humanity, I think everyone can rest so much easier."
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4229381592" "I think it's a very brave thing you're doing.  We are all here to assist you in any way we can.  We want peace as much as you do."

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1468805536" "What is going on?"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2938314059" "Nooo!"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_CHATTER_HUMAN_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2775442681" "Run!"

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1699952052" "Peace: Necessary.  Traditionalists: Agree"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3505830574" "Agree: Peace"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1120688347" "Success: Hopeful  Conference: Necessary"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P847210296" "Future: Hope"

// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1796671767" "Humans: Flee!  Safety: First!"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P927283155" "Nemesis: Thwart!"
// PEACECONFERENCE_ATMOSPHERIC_ATTENDEES_RIKTI_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3822680852" "Conference: Raid! Nemesis: Failure Imminent!"

// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2969953580" "You look smokin'.  How 'together' are you and Faultline REALLY?"
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1442331837" "All I'm sayin' is I have a LOT of money and no one to spend it on."
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1052177376" "What has that Faultline guy got that I don't have?  I'm rich.  Successful.  I'm a great catch."
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2730067995" "She's pretty easy on the eyes, isn't she, boys?"
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3870117876" "I can see what you call yourself Fusionette because you're definitely having an effect on me."
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4080339906" "What are you doing later?  I mean, besides saving the world."

// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4131553691" "Oh I see how it is."
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P206462123" "Your loss."
// FUSIONETTEFANBOIS_ATMOSPHERIC_NPC_CHATTER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3592266916" "I wasn't really into her anyway."

// VBI_VANGUARDQUARTERMASTER_FEMALE_FALLENSURPRISE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1245420788" "Hey!  How did you get in here?  Ungh. . ."

// FB_SWHW_ELEVATORGUARD_LOYALIST_INACTIVE :
