// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4022967685" "Dead meat.  Totally."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4052804113" "Glad that's not me going in there."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1656798021" "Oh man, this is going to be ugly."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P818005681" "So dead."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4060023601" "Dunno what they did, but make sure I never do that."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4283429188" "Did you see that THING-- Shhh.  They're coming."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1849324572" "I don't know, it had parts and bits and looked like a metal machine that moved.  Right out of a science fiction movie."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3609109240" "Sorry, man.  But you're dead."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3457281351" "I give you two minutes."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1170101892" "Two minutes?  That's generous.  I give ya 30 seconds."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2825968553" "I'm stoked.  I haven't seen a dedication challenge before.  Have you?"
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P440475398" "I hope you got Band-Aids."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4003439918" "Don't get all stuck up about it.  Just because you made it."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1720381969" "Hey you!  Think fast!"

// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2209575637" "Hm?  Oh.  Yeah.  They'll be gone before I even finish my drink."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1192703815" "So dead.  Gonna be pummeled blacker than this coffee I'm drinking."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_DRINKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P741532938" "So, did you see Steve taking bets?  You should get in on it."

// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P683673655" "Why watch?  It'll be over by the time I'm done my article."
// FB_SWHW_GAUNTLET_DOOMSAYER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1113118493" "Yawn.  I got better things to do than watch someone get walked all over.  Unless I'm doing it."
