// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1584072268" "I just got off shift.  I'm not sure what I want to do first.  Play a mission or write one."
// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P4046205251" "Place is pretty cool.  Hope Arachnos doesn't attack while we're in here."
// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P710708674" "This is a nice break from fighting Rikti.  I think I'm gonna write a mission with me defeating them.  Over and over again.  Oh wait, I already do."

// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P549579537" "Hehe."
// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P2069112175" "Whatever, man."
// RWZ_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P2671445345" "Good one."

// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3407744238" "I'm looking out the lobby window of the Architect building now.  It's pretty cool, you should come by."
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1781176792" "No, I'm in the Galaxy City location, not Atlas Park.  I told you that."
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2056220198" "Are you coming? I need help on all those big words!  Hurry up!"
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P732176175" "I'm standing right here in the lobby.  Trust me, you're not here.  Well, what location are you?"
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1824073608" "Noooo, I said Galaxy City, silly!"
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3475712588" "Okay, well hurry up.  I'll meet you in the lobby then we can go up together!"

// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P931508912" "Yeah, man, I'm in the Galaxy City building.  Wanna collaborate?"
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3157042590" "Yeah, this place is cool.  I can practically see the whole city from the main room."
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2334649909" "Hello?  Can you hear me?  You there?  I'm in Galaxy City!  Yeah!  Meet me there!"
// GALAXY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1448407315" "I'm gonna take over the world.  What's your mission gonna be?"

// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P95821553" "Huh, this place looks interesting.  Wonder if I should go in..."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3089604930" "Huh, what this all about, anyway?"
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P1973782029" "Hm...wonder if this is like the Consignment Houses."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2414349501" "Well, this is new.  Wonder what it's all about..."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2020341496" "Huh..."

// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P2154326911" "You know, the front door's wide open.  You can go in, if you want to."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P3713175194" "Why are you standing out here?  The door's not locked."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P2033646351" "It's the Architect Entertainment building.  You make missions in there."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P2695576717" "That have these all over Paragon City, you know.  And you can go inside, too."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P2574536605" "They'll let you in, you know.  It's a public building."

// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P3676875801" "Oh man, this is the best idea ever!"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P2256559815" "I'm gonna write the best mission in the whole world!"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P3985685448" "I can write my whole history into this mission..."
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P1643567508" "I'm glad I'm in plain clothes.  No one would even suspect who I really am."
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P2695228767" "Oh!  I could do a Rikti invasion of Midnighter Club!  That would be awesome!"

// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P101840937" "What are you doing?"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P2045728295" "What are you writing?"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P586033451" "What's that you're scribbling?"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P1578668618" "You writing down mission ideas?"
// GALAXY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P4181371747" "Are you gonna write me into any of your missions?  Please?"

// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P1201966036" "Wow, it all looks so amazing, I don't know where to start!"
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P2705912180" "What would you do?  Where would you start?"
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P191491421" "So, how do I go about making a mission anyway?"
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P838387535" "Hm...I don't know where to begin."

// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P1484065496" "Oh, it's easy.  Just talk to the Architect Greeter or one of the staff.  They'll help you."
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P2091433061" "You can talk to an Architect Trainer.  They can help get you going."
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P961759232" "Plenty of staff around here, why don't you ask one for help?"
// GALAXY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P1566072272" "We should ask a staff member for help."

// GALAXY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3823476530" "Architect Entertainment!  Come inside our Galaxy City location!  Make a mission!  Play a mission!"
// GALAXY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3778455773" "Grand new opening of Architect Entertainment Galaxy City!  Make a mission, you know you want to!"
// GALAXY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2277036035" "What are you waiting for?  Go on in and make a mission!  Play them, too!"
// GALAXY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P4022044406" "Open all day and all night, 365 days a year!"
// GALAXY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3776674196" "Check out Architect Entertainment!  It'll blow your socks off!"

// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2583033163" "Hey, you look pretty well-to-do.  Got a quarter?"
// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P39917715" "Oh sure, just run on past me like I'm not even here."
// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3878647167" "Spare a little something for a guy down on his luck?"
// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2578032265" "I'd be so grateful if you'd make my cup go 'plink!."
// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P766391692" "Hey, you.  Help a guy out?"
// GALAXY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1360201465" "Be the nicest hero in Galaxy City.  Help a guy out."

// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1137172756" "Wow, a real architecture building!  Wait, I don't think this is a school..."
// GALAXY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3701025033" "Hm...I don't see any drafting tables inside, but maybe it's early yet!"

// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P2376732630" "Well, this place certainly is something, isn't it?  What a nice view of the city."
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P436879474" "I could sit here all day.  It's nice and quiet.  And what about that view!"
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P2004402850" "Well this is much more preferable to being chased all over Galaxy City by thugs, isn't it?"
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P4106828151" "I'm quite comfortable.  Maybe I'll go over and make a mission later.  Did I mention I was comfortable?"
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P120428727" "You know, a small restaurant in this building and I'd probably never leave."
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P3388897328" "Oh, I'm just plain exhausted.  I was working on my mission well through the night trying to get it just perfect."

// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P402824053" "Wow!"
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P3570631012" "Well that's something, isn't it?"
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P834757838" "This place is remarkable."
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P721529427" "I feel creative just standing here."
// GALAXY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P2045337810" "I do love the view of Galaxy City."

// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2948732756" "I told you, like, four times that I'm at the Steel Canyon location.  I'm in the lobby waiting, would you hurry up?"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3183380638" "I can't get started until you're here and you're not here.  No, if you were in the correct building we'd be staring at each other."
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2577332171" "No, I said SC  but I meant Steel Canyon, not Skyway City."
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1056561025" "Fine.  I'll wait.  Just hop the train and I'll see you soon."
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P908633342" "What?  Why are you there?  It'll be a zoo!"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2757853801" "He wrote me into a mission?  Really?  No really, REALLY?"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P296057227" "Well, I don't know what I'm going to write.  Maybe I'll just play a few and see how that goes."

// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P668660509" "Buddy, get down here.  We'll play a few missions together."
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1262114818" "Yeah, I have been waiting on you for an hour.  Where are you?"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P62829098" "I'm taking a break, man.  I've been working on that console forever.  My creative juices have dried up."
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3764420501" "I don't care what it's about, I just want to fight alongside Ghost Widow.  She's hot!"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1370221895" "I don't care what it's about, I just want to make Manticore my pet!"
// STEEL_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P144606080" "That's been done.  Yes.  Uh uh, that too.  And...that one."

// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2055308318" "Hm...looks the same as the one in Skyway.  Wonder what's up in there?"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2198828176" "Wonder what's in there, some kind of arcade?"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2954205624" "Well this looks pretty high tech..."
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P1199194947" "Boy, they're sure upgrading Steel Canyon these days."
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3757851213" "I should go in and see what's going on in there."

// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P1822524957" "You could always just walk in the front door.  I'm pretty sure it's not locked."
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P2468562777" "Why don't you go in?"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P3600249599" "What are you doing standing out here?  Go on in."

// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P887830605" "I am a genius!"
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P4136676656" "Oooo...this is good.  This is really good."
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P351129875" "I'm the most original person on the planet!"
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P3016144513" "Hm...no, used that plot device before.  Can't be too transparent, of course..."
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P1562926819" "This is going to be so good that everyone is going to want to play it!"
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P3061998537" "I'm gonna be famous when I post this mission!  What an idea!"

// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P1645971210" "Why don't you just do that on the consoles they have?"
// STEEL_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P2360215289" "Is that a...sketch?"

// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P4211996892" "I love the look of the place, but I'm not sure where to begin!"
// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P2214001726" "I've never created a mission before!  I don't know where to start!"
// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P487830276" "Oh, so many thoughts and ideas in my head!  Where should I start?"
// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P914050484" "Where do you think I should start?"

// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P2203176558" "I'm sure the Greeter down in the lobby can help you out."
// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P978974377" "You should talk to the staff, they're all over the place."
// STEEL_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P1144304827" "There's staff all over the place.  Let's ask one."

// STEEL_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2521694753" "Most fun you can have in Steel Canyon without spilling blood!  Architect Entertainment!  Come check it out!"
// STEEL_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3686686140" "Architect Entertainment is open 24 hours a day for all your mission-making and playing needs!"
// STEEL_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P649809476" "Think you got the chops to make a great mission?  Come give it a shot!  Architect Entertainment!"
// STEEL_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P450278285" "Come on, people!  Use all those purse snatchings and muggings as the core storyline of a new mission!  You know you want to!"
// STEEL_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2870685435" "Steel Canyon Architect Entertainment location open for business!  Get creating!"

// STEEL_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3146830431" "People say that Steel Canyon has the nicest heroes.  Nicest maybe, but cheap, too.  Hmph."
// STEEL_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1362537369" "Hey you.  Be a hero.  Spread the love."
// STEEL_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P20377255" "I should have moved on to Atlas Park.  At least they give you the time of day there."
// STEEL_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P2508675083" "Huh?  Wha?  What you looking at?"

// STEEL_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3103823959" "This place is huge!"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3854160363" "This is, like, a city block wide!"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2336241277" "This building is something!"
// STEEL_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3847553918" "I love architecture!  Where are the drafting tables?"

// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P382065267" "I never realized how taxing writing an epic mission can be!  I just need to sit a minute."
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1975704522" "I was playing a few missions earlier.  I'm taking a break now.  It sure is fun, though!"
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P338986984" "I'm taking a break before I have to go back on duty.  Crime never sleeps."
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P979533571" "I just saw a mission about our group.  Isn't that funny?"
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1532036717" "Who knew there was so much that goes into writing a really good mission?"
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P70671633" "I can't wait to play my sister's mission.  She put me in it!"

// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P1907028624" "Wow, I can imagine."
// STEEL_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P1309512354" "That's interesting."

// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P251246470" "Honey, I told you three times that I was going to wait for you at the Skyway City building.  I did.  Three times!"
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P35031031" "Well, I'm not going to go there.  We said meeting Skyway and that's where I am.  You come to me."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3467704734" "Like it'll kill you to hop a bus.  Come ON."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P280824595" "If you're not here in the next ten minutes, I'm heading up on my own."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1233236486" "Oh, I thought you said Skyway City.  Well, can't you come here?"

// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P4136223423" "Dude.  That's all I gotta say.  DUDE."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P623023844" "I have been here for hours.  You gotta come over.  I'll write a really cool mission for ya."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1510998848" "I'm in the lobby, man.  Where you at?"
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3754029682" "No, you said meet in Skyway City.  That's where I am.  I don't see you."
// SKYWAY_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P237683005" "Ha!  You just missed it.  I saw a Troll get mown down by a police drone.  Yeah.  Right in front of the building.  Too funny."

// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3546978904" "What do we have here?"
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3528803939" "This doesn't look like a drafting firm..."
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P2393703252" "When did they put this building here?  This wasn't here last week..."
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P450116906" "I don't get what this place is..."

// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
