// SKYWAY_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P1347052013" "Whatcha writing?"

// SKYWAY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P2697815481" "This place is so impressive!  I don't know where to start!"
// SKYWAY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P2714889843" "I am so impressed!  How do I get started?"
// SKYWAY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P3852576333" "I think I need a tutorial or something.  I don't know where to start."

