// SKYWAY_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P1587728316" "Plenty of staff here to ask.  You should talk to one."

// SKYWAY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2696237020" "Most fun you can have in Skyway City without taking down Trolls!  Architect Entertainment come on down!"
// SKYWAY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2843457143" "Architect  Entertainment!  Open 24/7 for your convenience all around Paragon City!"
// SKYWAY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2541979866" "Come on in to Architect Entertainment and get your mission on!"
// SKYWAY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2038198881" "Think you can tell a better story than your friend?  Prove it!  Architect Entertainment!"
// SKYWAY_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P544769951" "Come on, people!  You know you're  curious!  Check it out!"

// SKYWAY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
