// SKYWAY_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1018637939" "Can ya?"

// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2054223119" "Wow, this is some building!"
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P4281410726" "Look at those lines!"
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P841732771" "What structure!"
// SKYWAY_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P2741759427" "I love the way the glass and brick meld together!"

// SKYWAY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P3141084577" "This place is so posh!"
// SKYWAY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P320526415" "I think I saw Synapse in here earlier.  He was in his street clothes, but I could tell!"
// SKYWAY_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1016206249" "Oh this is fun!"


// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2667757746" "Honey, I told you three times that I was going to wait for you at the Faultline building.  I did.  Three times!"
// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3040277659" "Well, I'm not going to go there.  We said meeting Faultline and that's where I am.  You come to me."
// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P355251329" "Like it'll kill you jog over here.  Come ON."
// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3293912510" "Oh, I thought you said Faultline.  Well, can't you come here?"

// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1591945780" "No, you said meet in Faultline.  That's where I am.  I don't see you."
// FAULTLINE_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P696376754" "Ha!  You just missed it.  I saw some Lost get mown down by a police drone.  Yeah.  Right in front of the building.  Too funny."







// FAULTLINE_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P2719829892" "Most fun you can have in Faultline without going into sugar shock!  Architect Entertainment come on down!"

// FAULTLINE_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P335332189" "I'm gonna remember you..."
// FAULTLINE_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1463887286" "Help a guy?"
// FAULTLINE_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P575623526" "Hey, pal, spare some coin?"


// FAULTLINE_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1166501703" "I think I saw Mirror Spirit in here earlier.  She was in his street clothes, but I could tell!"


// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3998122015" "Oh wow, this place is so cool!"

// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
"P1184764741" "Easy.  Be cool.  Yeah, it's great!"

// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P3470874962" "Greeters are a good way to get started."

// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1473038800" "You know, this entire building brings a certain class to Kings Row, don't you think?"
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P3302736789" "I just need to rest.  I must have been writing for three hours!"
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P1353289839" "I love this place.  I feel so creative!"
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_SITTER_TEXT :
"P3412389214" "I'm quite enjoying this place.  I suppose I should get to work soon..."

// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P39058422" "It's quite something."
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P1439689875" "I totally agree."
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P3517117200" "If they had a cafeteria, I don't think I'd ever leave."
// KINGSROW_AE_SOFACHAT_NPC_STANDER_TEXT :
"P1717226288" "You're quite right."

// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P4169152207" "Huh...wonder what's in there?"
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3581541223" "I should go in..."
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P948020525" "Hmm...who are those people?"
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_TEXT :
"P3541030022" "Hm, wonder what they're doing in there?"

// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P1951527034" "You know, you can walk right in the door if you want."
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P10623765" "You CAN go inside, you know."
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CURIOUSGUY_SMARTYPANTS_TEXT :
"P365503014" "Why are you standing out here?"

// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P562871710" "I'm in Kings Row. I told you I'd be here, silly.  No.  No you're wrong.  No YOU are."
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3443645213" "But that's so far.  I thought you said Kings Row.  But I'm here now.  Can't you come to me?"
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P2099830599" "No way.  Seriously?  SERIOUSLY?  NO way."
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P3953249336" "I'm right by the window in the lobby.  You can't miss me."
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_FEMALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P1833501823" "Wait...what?"

// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P689251537" "Hurry up, man.  I want to get upstairs and play a few missions."
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P200188430" "Come on, man, I told you Kings Row.  Why did you go all the way to Skyway City?"
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P81160359" "Hang on, my reception sucks.  Can I just call you back?"
// KINGSROW_AE_CELLPHONE_NPC_MALE_TALKER_TEXT :
"P55840942" "Yeah, I'll be here.  Oh yeah, so cool.  You'll love it."

// KINGSROW_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P782313364" "Ohmigosh!  I could write an entire mission in Drapzik!  How fun would that be?"
// KINGSROW_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_SCRIBBLER_TEXT :
"P1059047024" "I wonder if I should make a mission about a kind leader who is attacked by rabbits.  Wonder what I could use as the rabbits.  Hm.  Rikti Monkeys?"

// KINGSROW_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P2026400615" "Why don't you just type that on one of the consoles upstairs?"
// KINGSROW_AE_IDEAGUY_NPC_WHATCHADOING_TEXT :
"P624227058" "What's that?"

// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P1434348165" "Well, I just don't know where to start."
// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P3766230995" "This place is quite something, isn't it?  Should we take a peek upstairs later?"
// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_CLUELESS_TEXT :
"P3359376254" "Oh, my goodness, well I can't decide if I want to enjoy the atmosphere or go play a mission."

// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P3002166558" "You should speak to a Greeter.  They're really helpful."
// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P2731508434" "I like this place."
// KINGSROW_ARCHITECT_NEWBIES_NPC_HELPFUL_TEXT :
"P3007506710" "I know what you mean."

// KINGSROW_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P3954604731" "Visit Architect Entertainment!  Right here in Kings Row!"
// KINGSROW_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P4255244954" "For all your creative mission needs, come visit Architect Entertainment!  You know you want to!"
// KINGSROW_AE_PAMPHLET_NPC_TEXT :
"P1696401410" "Come on by!  Architect Entertainment is open 24/7!"

// KINGSROW_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P357313584" "Help a guy out?"
// KINGSROW_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P3603319487" "It's better to give than receive!"
// KINGSROW_AE_PANHANDLER_NPC_TEXT :
"P1729480857" "Hey, if you help me out today, I'll pay you back Tuesday.  Ish."

// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P1255401577" "Ooooo."
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3686620074" "Wow...that's quite something!"
// KINGSROW_AE_NPC_CAMERA_TEXT :
"P3705196" "What a building!"

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P1522488704" "Tell us more!"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P665030105" "Can you describe the scene?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P753592809" "What was it like?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P4236077037" "Can you comment on the tragedy?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3812166576" "Any words for the victims?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P2893889401" "What will happen next?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P1581494189" "Can you say more about the meteors?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P2673763867" "Describe the feelings that came over you when you saw the scene."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P869461664" "Can you comment on the role Arachnos played in the tragedy?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P985315272" "Can you provide an estimate of the number of casualties?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P61803210" "Is Galaxy City destroyed?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P1559348186" "What is the situation in Galaxy City?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P4172394660" "How did you come to be a hero?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3084681330" "Describe the meteors."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3262303743" "Do you mind if we get a picture?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3843467455" "What have we learned from this event?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P2504525251" "What's the bottom line? What happened in Galaxy City?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P378845717" "What role did Back Alley Brawler play in this event?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3676848232" "Can we get a picture?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA :
"P3846456133" "Is it true that aliens have invaded Galaxy City?"

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA1 :
"P4259971356" "Well, I was on my way to a costume contest when I heard the news. Terrible, isn't it?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA1 :
"P1958220207" "Honestly, I think I have a great chance to win the contest with this costume. What's that? Oh, yes, the situation in Galaxy City. Very horrible."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA1 :
"P1215072256" "Yes, yes, tragedy in Galaxy City and all that. I think switching to this new polyester-rayon blend was a good idea, don't you?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA1 :
"P4033485893" "Any other questions? Perhaps about the colors I've chosen for my costume? Glad you asked...."

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P4188609149" "The scene was horrific. The city burning, meteors streaking through the sky. Bodies everywhere. Luckily, I've got a strong stomach."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P3360998436" "You know, to answer that question, I really must start at the beginning. I was born like any other ordinary person - weak."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P2402249938" "It wasn't until that fateful day in the third grade when Margaret Pennywhistle beat me up under the monkey bars that my powers first manifested."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P380720887" "I will soon make my way to Galaxy City. Evil beware. What's that? Well, yes, I may have missed most of the action, but there is always work to be done."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P1756551330" "Great deeds require great people such as myself."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P1741930422" "Thanks for the kind words. Yes, saving people is what I do. It's a calling, really."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA2 :
"P1662548212" "You getting all of this? You sure you have enough paper on that pad?"

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P151268137" "Yes, Arachnos did attempt to invade Galaxy City. Not to worry, folks. We took care of the situation."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P2509391674" "I know that we will not rest until Galaxy City has been rebuilt."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P474613873" "I would like to call on every citizen of Paragon City to send canned food and clothing to the nearest shelter. We need YOUR help."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P2711221574" "I can't say enough about the Paragon Police Department. They did a great job of evacuating the population in the first hours of the attack."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P614437860" "Yes, yes, Galaxy City was attacked. This was not a natural disaster."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA3 :
"P2239485655" "Good point. Yes, we need to remember this event - learn from it. We must honor the lives of the victims not by mourning, but by taking the fight to all who seek to do evil."

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA4 :
"P1594309443" "Yes, I can confirm vast destruction in Galaxy City. There are portions that are practically unrecognizable."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA4 :
"P3734445857" "Interesting question. I am not certain the exact science behind the meteors, but I am prepared to say they were not a natural occurance."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA4 :
"P3492865341" "The current situation in Galaxy City is not good. The police have sealed off all entrances into the city."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA4 :
"P2485541084" "No, I will not be going back to the city. My work there is done. What will I be doing? I will be here, of course. We do have serious problems with the Hellions, you know."

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA5 :
"P4119455358" "Yes, I was in Galaxy City when it was damaged by the meteors. It was not, how do you say, pleasant."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA5 :
"P902831452" "Many, many people were injured. Some could not bear their wounds and succumbed to them. It was very sad."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA5 :
"P3353576996" "I implore the good people of Paragon City to give whatever they can to shelters and relief organizations."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA5 :
"P1545411374" "No, no, I have never seen anything like this tragedy. I pray that the good people of Paragon City will ever have to suffer through such a disaster in the future."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_MEDIA5 :
"P332986700" "Thank you for your time. It is important that we get the word out to everyone in Paragon City. Your donations are needed to help the victims of the tragedy in Galaxy City."

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P2402902513" "Families are encouraged to wait until we have more news of the situation in Galaxy City."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P843001874" "I would like to remind you to please refrain from calling the police department. We are working hard to address this situation and need all of our phone circuits open."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P809548619" "I have received word that if you do not see your loved one's name on the list of survivors, you should visit the Paragon City Department of Grief and Counseling immediately."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P148620931" "I would like to squelch rumors that the aliens attacking Galaxy City are in our sewers. That is absolutely not true."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P978560021" "I would like to remind people to refrain from drinking from the fountains. The water in those fountains contains a lot of chlorine and you could die."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P777032935" "There have been rumors that some of the refugees have been stealing local pets and eating them. We've investigated and have made one arrest. I would like to stress that this was an isolated incident."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P3879476626" "If a loved one has died, we will call you to view and identify the body or bodies."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES1 :
"P3037101291" "I have new casualties to report: Malina Smith, Charles Salstrom, Vernon G. Windlof, and Miles Stephen Stranton. If you are related to or know these people, please report to the Paragon City Department of Grief and Counseling immediately."

// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P2273016388" "I'm looking for my father. How can I find him?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P3518671582" "My sister lives in Galaxy City. I haven't heard from her. What do I do?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P1694921536" "Is there a list of the dead?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P354322327" "The hospital won't give me any information. I need to find my sister."
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P1060930495" "I need to go to Galaxy City. Can I get in?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P1575746888" "My son was on a field trip in Galaxy City. Was his return bus delayed?"
// ATLASPARK_GCSHUTDOWN_LOSSES2 :
"P797998927" "My mother lives in a retirement home in Galaxy City, but she isn't among the refugees here. I need to know that she made it out okay."
