// BRICKSTOWN_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P417137244" "Prisoner arches still at large! Fifteen and counting!"


// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P1288738835" "I'm not wastin' no time with culture shock. I gotta make a name for myself here."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P2771369514" "Compared to First Ward this town is great! So authentic."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P3480179258" "Yeah, but I'm not gonna dwel in the past about what happened in First Ward.<em>Cole ran that place into the dirt. Litteraly!"
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P1221812447" "I never gave a damn about that chump Cole. But this {Rescuer} person, now there's a REAL hero!"
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P4195724647" "I wish I coulda seen the look on Tyrant's face just before {Rescuer}'s boot came down on it."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_CIVILIAN_TEXT :
"P3984344605" "Man, we got outta there just in time."

// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P1959535546" "We must work together to find our way in this new realm."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P1543898923" "I don't care how bad it may get from here-on. I'm NOT about to be a street performer!"
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P3601186553" "Can you believe it's all gone? I keep waking up forgetting."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P232581684" "It's good to see a familiar face."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P2119134233" "I acknowledge that {Rescuer} saved us. I'm just... trying to wrap my head around this whole mess."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P1854662246" "I must say this place is filthy compared to Imperial City. But at least now we are free from tyranny."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_COL_TEXT :
"P407335659" "Thanks to the help of {Rescuer} we are all safe. And that is all that matters now."

// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P4172370784" "Been thinking about joining the PPD. I kinda miss bustin' heads, ya know."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P1667975557" "If I ever see that {Rescuer} in person, I'm buying that hero a beer!<em>...that reminds me, I need a job."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P3263929565" "We ALL owe that {Rescuer} hero owr lives. You'd do well to remember that."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P1613086893" "I think I'm going to like this little town."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P853407187" "I feel so much freer now that I'm outta First Ward. Like I can finally breathe."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P2964008519" "So far this place seems much more real than our old home."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P1201578135" "Good riddance to First Ward. I'm going to love this town."
// BRICKSTOWN_REFUGEE_FORLORN_TEXT :
"P3184859677" "So, how's this place been treating you?"

// KINGS_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2581766293" "Is Clockwork activity on the rise in Kings Row? Local citizens seem to believe so. Find out more in today's Paragon Times!"
// KINGS_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1444609949" "Skulls linked to major superadine ring in Kings Row, but do the police have enough manpower to bring them down? Find out in today's Paragon Times!"
// KINGS_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2977528029" "Missing persons on the rise, but is the Circle of Thorns or Vahzilok to blame? Find out more when you pick up your Paragon Times today!"
// KINGS_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P86252308" "Galaxy City refugees to blame for most recent crime wave in Kings Row! Learn more when you pick up your Paragon Times today!"
// KINGS_NEWSIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P80714561" "Police to crack down on superadine ring! Read all about it!"

// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P872178595" "...smells good."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145059856" "Smellin' good now."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183644004" "Something smells..."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1042071607" "Gettin' hungry."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1308187732" "I can't be havin' these negative thoughts."

// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2519405895" "Gotta stay low. Cant let the aliens change me like they did the others."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P494182083" "Those guys had a good point today. Maybe it is better to be touched by the aliens."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P667243146" "I swear I see robots everywhere."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1505054642" "First my friends are taken over by aliens, now robots..? Am I crazy?"
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4109735565" "I'm gonna make a come back."
// KINGS_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4018395632" "I know I'm a winner. Things are gonna change, I can feel it."

// KINGS_NPC_BUM_PANHANDLE_TEXT :
"P4158608872" "Anything helps."
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_PANHANDLE_TEXT :
"P1848366065" "Help out a vet?"
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_PANHANDLE_TEXT :
"P586743515" "Have a heart. Help out a vet."

// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P843337578" "So, yeah, it looks like we're a go for tonight. Where do you want to meet up?"
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1043083990" "Sure, call her, and we'll meet at the Italian place."
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1632351252" "No, this town has a bad vibe. I want to just get in and out."
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1449799655" "Yeah, you might need an umbrella."
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1968750634" "Oh, I dunno know... Six-ish?"
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1985367741" "Yeah, so until then looks like I'm pretty much stuck here."
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P680080178" "So, I didn't get the job... Oh, some dipstick, I'm sure."
// KINGS_SMARTPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3133195553" "Wait, why do I need to plan for everything?"

// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P3143239939" "Hmm... gotta be somethin' in here..."
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P2500758502" "Where'd it go...?"
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P839813100" "I smell it, but I don't see it."
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P1793610053" "One's trash is another's get-by."
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P3216178584" "Jackpot!"
// KINGS_NPC_BUM_SCAVENGE_TEXT :
"P121794009" "Hmph... nuthin'."

// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1563309456" "Am I crazy, or are robots taking over the town?"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1046087017" "I saw one of those big robots rampaging again. It was attacking anything that moved!"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1977594083" "The Skulls are getting out of control and no one seems to care."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P950703186" "I don't care what the papers say. Brickstown doesn't hold a candle to the crime wave we got here in Kings Row."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1234610066" "This town is doomed. If I could move away, I would in a heartbeat."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1350437573" "I live on the top floor of my apartment, but every night I swear I can hear screaming above me."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2621162059" "I sometimes see a strange glow coming from the Royal Refinery at night. Do you know what that's about?"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3514135212" "I've been hearing panting coming from the Royal Refinery at night. Maybe you could check it out next time you're on patrol."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3491767326" "Something stinks just due south of the monorail station. I'm guessing it's another murder no one bothered to investigate."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3979801519" "I looked out my window the other night and saw zombies! Just like in the movies! When will this madness end??"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3480401361" "I saw two men digging up a body last night behind my building. Then I watched as all three of them walked away together!"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2126106799" "My car got dismantled again last night. Guess I'll be walking to work for the forseeable future."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P531037329" "I never paid much attention to the homeless until one of them tried to accost me the other day. He didn't even look human."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P748235111" "Something is terribly wrong with the homeless in this town. Have you seen them lately?"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P147252843" "The other night I was walking my dog around the building and she found a human face just lying there in the parking lot! I nearly had a heart attack!"
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2122431685" "I don't know what to say except this town needs more heroes."
// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752897280" "The villains in this town know there aren't enough heroes to stop them all. That's why it's going to hell in a hand basket."

// KINGS_PPD_ANGRY_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2624024311" "Those damned robots dismantled my friggin' car! I DEMAND to know what's being done about this!"
// KINGS_PPD_ANGRY_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3961482134" "Those Skulls are pushing superadine right outside my apartment! I'm starting to wonder if you cops are in on it."
// KINGS_PPD_ANGRY_CITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P230855793" "How am I?? My car got stolen again, that's how I am! And how the hell are you, officer?"

// KINGS_PPD_CHAT_CITIZEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3089211371" "Get down, citizen!"

